14.0587 9.16602L10.8331 5.94044L5.84581 10.9287ZM15.3634 4.63673C14.5281 3.80141 13.2057 3.74938 12.3097 4.48048L12.1368 4.63673L11.7735 5.00001L15.0001 8.22559L15.3634 7.86329L15.5196 7.68946C16.2015 6.85326 16.2015 5.64676 15.5196 4.81056L15.3634 4.63673Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div></article><article class="text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]" tabindex="-1" dir="auto" data-turn-id="71f35179-36b6-4158-ad9c-18a12b5ef792" data-testid="conversation-turn-2" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="assistant"><h6 class="sr-only">ChatGPT said:</h6><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] thread-sm:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] thread-lg:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] thread-lg:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn" tabindex="-1"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="b6518756-266a-46b4-9ac0-fd5c8dac8222" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="299">Η <strong data-start="2" data-end="20">παραγωγικότητα</strong> ορίζεται ως ο λόγος του παραγόμενου αποτελέσματος (output) προς τους χρησιμοποιούμενους πόρους ή συντελεστές παραγωγής (input). Με απλά λόγια, δείχνει πόσο αποδοτικά αξιοποιούνται οι διαθέσιμοι πόροι (εργασία, κεφάλαιο, πρώτες ύλες, χρόνος) για να παραχθούν αγαθά ή υπηρεσίες.</p>
<p data-start="301" data-end="325">Ο γενικός τύπος είναι:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext>Παραγωγικ</mtext><mover accent="true"><mtext>ο</mtext><mo>ˊ</mo></mover><mtext>τητα</mtext></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>Παραγ</mtext><mover accent="true"><mtext>ο</mtext><mo>ˊ</mo></mover><mtext>μενη&nbsp;ποσ</mtext><mover accent="true"><mtext>ο</mtext><mo>ˊ</mo></mover><mtext>τητα&nbsp;προ</mtext><mover accent="true"><mtext>ι</mtext><mo>¨</mo></mover><mover accent="true"><mtext>ο</mtext><mo>ˊ</mo></mover><mtext>ντος&nbsp;</mtext><mover accent="true"><mtext>η</mtext><mo>ˊ</mo></mover><mtext>&nbsp;αξ</mtext><mover accent="true"><mtext>ι</mtext><mo>ˊ</mo></mover><mtext>α</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>Π</mtext><mover accent="true"><mtext>ο</mtext><mo>ˊ</mo></mover><mtext>ροι&nbsp;που&nbsp;χρησιμοποιο</mtext><mover accent="true"><mtext>υ</mtext><mo>ˊ</mo></mover><mtext>νται</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{Παραγωγικότητα} = \frac{\text{Παραγόμενη ποσότητα προϊόντος ή αξία}}{\text{Πόροι που χρησιμοποιούνται}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Παραγωγικ</span><span class="mord accent"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.6944em;"><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord">ο</span></span><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="accent-body" style="left: -0.25em;"><span class="mord">ˊ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord">τητα</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 2.0574em; vertical-align: -0.686em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mopen nulldelimiter"></span><span class="mfrac"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 1.3714em;"><span style="top: -2.314em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Π</span><span class="mord accent"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.6944em;"><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord">ο</span></span><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="accent-body" style="left: -0.25em;"><span class="mord">ˊ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord">ροι&nbsp;που&nbsp;χρησιμοποιο</span><span class="mord accent"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.6944em;"><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord">υ</span></span><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="accent-body" style="left: -0.25em;"><span class="mord">ˊ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord">νται</span></span></span></span><span style="top: -3.23em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="frac-line" style="border-bottom-width: 0.04em;"></span></span><span style="top: -3.677em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Παραγ</span><span class="mord accent"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.6944em;"><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord">ο</span></span><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="accent-body" style="left: -0.25em;"><span class="mord">ˊ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord">μενη&nbsp;ποσ</span><span class="mord accent"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.6944em;"><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord">ο</span></span><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="accent-body" style="left: -0.25em;"><span class="mord">ˊ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord">τητα&nbsp;προ</span><span class="mord accent"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.6679em;"><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord">ι</span></span><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="accent-body" style="left: -0.25em;"><span class="mord">¨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord accent"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.6944em;"><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord">ο</span></span><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="accent-body" style="left: -0.25em;"><span class="mord">ˊ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord">ντος&nbsp;</span><span class="mord accent"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.6944em;"><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord">η</span></span><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="accent-body" style="left: -0.25em;"><span class="mord">ˊ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord">&nbsp;αξ</span><span class="mord accent"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.6944em;"><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord">ι</span></span><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="accent-body" style="left: -0.25em;"><span class="mord">ˊ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord">α</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.686em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose nulldelimiter"></span></span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="444" data-end="462">🔹 Παραδείγματα:</p>
<ul data-start="463" data-end="719">
<li data-start="463" data-end="542">
<p data-start="465" data-end="542"><strong data-start="465" data-end="493">Εργασιακή παραγωγικότητα</strong>: Παραγόμενες μονάδες προϊόντος / Ώρες εργασίας</p>
</li>
<li data-start="543" data-end="641">
<p data-start="545" data-end="641"><strong data-start="545" data-end="574">Κεφαλαιακή παραγωγικότητα</strong>: Παραγόμενη αξία προϊόντος / Μονάδες κεφαλαίου (π.χ. μηχανήματα)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="642" data-end="719">
<p data-start="644" data-end="719"><strong data-start="644" data-end="668">Ολική παραγωγικότητα</strong>: Παραγόμενο αποτέλεσμα / Σύνολο όλων των εισροών</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="721" data-end="844" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Θέλεις να σου το εξηγήσω πιο αναλυτικά σε επίπεδο <strong data-start="771" data-end="785">οικονομίας</strong> (π.χ. εθνική παραγωγικότητα) ή σε επίπεδο <strong data-start="828" data-end="843">επιχείρησης</strong>;</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611