03 8.97046 11.0301C9.22989 11.2901 9.22945 11.7111 8.96948 11.9706L5.26733 15.6649H8.99976L9.13354 15.6786C9.43674 15.7404 9.66476 16.0085 9.66479 16.3299C9.66479 16.6514 9.43675 16.9194 9.13354 16.9813L8.99976 16.995H3.65991C3.29264 16.995 2.99487 16.6972 2.99487 16.3299V10.9998C2.99495 10.6326 3.29269 10.3348 3.65991 10.3348C4.02713 10.3348 4.32488 10.6326 4.32495 10.9998V14.7264L8.03003 11.0291ZM16.9949 8.99985C16.9949 9.36712 16.6971 9.66489 16.3298 9.66489C15.9626 9.66483 15.6648 9.36708 15.6648 8.99985V5.26743L11.9705 8.96957C11.711 9.22954 11.29 9.22998 11.03 8.97055C10.7702 8.71111 10.7697 8.29004 11.0291 8.03012L14.7263 4.32504H10.9998C10.6326 4.32494 10.3347 4.02721 10.3347 3.66C10.3347 3.2928 10.6326 2.99506 10.9998 2.99496H16.3298L16.4636 3.00864C16.7668 3.07053 16.9949 3.33854 16.9949 3.66V8.99985Z"></path></svg></button></span></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary" style="height: 350px;"><img class="my-1 max-h-full max-w-full object-contain" alt="Output image" width="1412" height="950" src="./placeholder_files/43738c9f-a935-4296-8880-fef31bdf4f82"></div><div></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="bc005de6-9e6c-442a-8992-8689859590f4" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="46">Ορίστε ένα διάγραμμα που δείχνει τη διαφορά:</p>
<ul data-start="48" data-end="314">
<li data-start="48" data-end="119">
<p data-start="50" data-end="119">Το <strong data-start="53" data-end="71">ονομαστικό ΑΕΠ</strong> ανεβαίνει γρήγορα επειδή οι τιμές αυξάνονται.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="120" data-end="202">
<p data-start="122" data-end="202">Το <strong data-start="125" data-end="143">πραγματικό ΑΕΠ</strong> αυξάνεται πιο αργά, καθώς μετρά την πραγματική παραγωγή.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="203" data-end="314">
<p data-start="205" data-end="314">Η <strong data-start="207" data-end="225">παραγωγικότητα</strong> βελτιώνεται μόνο όσο αυξάνεται το πραγματικό ΑΕΠ ανά εργαζόμενο, όχι απλώς λόγω τιμών.</p>
</li>
</ul>
