242 12.5761 4.66808 12.7451L4.54113 13.4619L4.14269 15.8555L4.14171 15.8574H4.14464L6.5382 15.458L7.25499 15.332C7.424 15.2977 7.5394 15.2669 7.64953 15.2266L7.80285 15.165C7.95455 15.0986 8.09947 15.0174 8.23644 14.9238L8.3839 14.8135C8.53668 14.6876 8.72225 14.5035 9.0714 14.1543L14.0587 9.16602L10.8331 5.94044L5.84581 10.9287ZM15.3634 4.63673C14.5281 3.80141 13.2057 3.74938 12.3097 4.48048L12.1368 4.63673L11.7735 5.00001L15.0001 8.22559L15.3634 7.86329L15.5196 7.68946C16.2015 6.85326 16.2015 5.64676 15.5196 4.81056L15.3634 4.63673Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div></article><article class="text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]" tabindex="-1" dir="auto" data-turn-id="cffacd62-3c52-4381-a69f-f6318cb4fcf2" data-testid="conversation-turn-14" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="assistant"><h6 class="sr-only">ChatGPT said:</h6><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] thread-sm:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] thread-lg:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] thread-lg:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn" tabindex="-1"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="cffacd62-3c52-4381-a69f-f6318cb4fcf2" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="195">Great question — investors and partners will want to hear how this idea makes money. For underwater filming with drones, here are the <strong data-start="134" data-end="158">main revenue streams</strong> you could highlight in your pitch:</p>
<hr data-start="197" data-end="200">
<p data-start="202" data-end="247">💰 <strong data-start="205" data-end="245">Revenue Model for Underwater Filming</strong></p>
<ol data-start="249" data-end="1099">
<li data-start="249" data-end="449">
<p data-start="252" data-end="274"><strong data-start="252" data-end="272">Tourist Packages</strong></p>
<ul data-start="278" data-end="449">
<li data-start="278" data-end="364">
<p data-start="280" data-end="364">Charge per trip (e.g., €20–50 per person) for access to the live drone experience.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="368" data-end="449">
<p data-start="370" data-end="449">Upsell premium packages with edited highlight videos or personalized footage.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="451" data-end="646">
<p data-start="454" data-end="484"><strong data-start="454" data-end="482">Boat Rental Partnerships</strong></p>
<ul data-start="488" data-end="646">
<li data-start="488" data-end="580">
<p data-start="490" data-end="580">Partner with boat rental companies to include the underwater drone as an add-on service.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="584" data-end="646">
<p data-start="586" data-end="646">Revenue share: boats get a cut for upselling your service.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="648" data-end="784">
<p data-start="651" data-end="674"><strong data-start="651" data-end="672">Content Licensing</strong></p>
<ul data-start="678" data-end="784">
<li data-start="678" data-end="784">
<p data-start="680" data-end="784">License unique underwater footage to hotels, travel agencies, documentaries, or social media creators.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="786" data-end="936">
<p data-start="789" data-end="820"><strong data-start="789" data-end="818">Subscription / Membership</strong></p>
<ul data-start="824" data-end="936">
<li data-start="824" data-end="936">
<p data-start="826" data-end="936">Locals or repeat tourists pay a seasonal or annual pass for unlimited access to underwater filming sessions.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="938" data-end="1099">
<p data-start="941" data-end="979"><strong data-start="941" data-end="977">Merchandising &amp; Digital Products</strong></p>
<ul data-start="983" data-end="1099">
<li data-start="983" data-end="1099">
<p data-start="985" data-end="1099">Offer tourists personalized souvenir videos, photo packages, or even AR/VR experiences built from drone footage.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="1101" data-end="1104">
<p data-start="1106" data-end="1474">👉 In your <strong data-start="1117" data-end="1145">elevator pitch extension</strong>, you could frame it like this:<br data-start="1176" data-end="1179">
<em data-start="1179" data-end="1472">"Our revenues come from a mix of tourist packages, partnerships with boat rentals, and premium video souvenirs. Imagine every tourist leaving Corfu not only with memories, but also a cinematic underwater video they can instantly share. That’s a new revenue line for us and for our partners.”</em></p>
<p data-start="1476" data-end="1626" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Do you want me to <strong data-start="1494" data-end="1520">run some quick numbers</strong> (e.g., boats × tourists × price point) so you have a ballpark revenue projection to drop into your pitch?</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10.66