<hr data-start="72" data-end="75">
<h3 data-start="77" data-end="128">Example Revenue Projection (Corfu Tourism Case)</h3>
<ul data-start="130" data-end="324">
<li data-start="130" data-end="191">
<p data-start="132" data-end="191"><strong data-start="132" data-end="171">Boat rentals available for tourists</strong>: 50 partner boats</p>
</li>
<li data-start="192" data-end="238">
<p data-start="194" data-end="238"><strong data-start="194" data-end="233">Average trips per day (high season)</strong>: 2</p>
</li>
<li data-start="239" data-end="267">
<p data-start="241" data-end="267"><strong data-start="241" data-end="262">Tourists per trip</strong>: 6</p>
</li>
<li data-start="268" data-end="324">
<p data-start="270" data-end="324"><strong data-start="270" data-end="317">Price per tourist for underwater experience</strong>: €25</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="326" data-end="433">👉 <strong data-start="329" data-end="371">Daily revenue potential (high season):</strong><br data-start="371" data-end="374">
50 boats × 2 trips × 6 tourists × €25 = <strong data-start="414" data-end="431">€15,000 / day</strong></p>
<p data-start="435" data-end="522">👉 <strong data-start="438" data-end="482">Monthly potential (30 days high season):</strong><br data-start="482" data-end="485">
€15,000 × 30 = <strong data-start="500" data-end="520">€450,000 / month</strong></p>
<p data-start="524" data-end="621">👉 <strong data-start="527" data-end="546">3-month season:</strong><br data-start="546" data-end="549">
≈ <strong data-start="551" data-end="582">€1.35 million gross revenue</strong> (before partner splits, costs, etc.)</p>
<hr data-start="623" data-end="626">
<p data-start="628" data-end="868">💡 You can present it like this in your pitch:<br data-start="674" data-end="677">
<em data-start="677" data-end="866">"By partnering with just 50 boats, we can generate over €1 million in seasonal revenue, while giving boat operators a powerful upsell and tourists an unforgettable, shareable experience."</em></p>
<hr data-start="870" data-end="873">
<p data-start="875" data-end="1028" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Do you want me to also <strong data-start="898" data-end="942">break this into investor-friendly slides</strong> (market size → business model → revenue potential) so you can use it in a pitch deck?</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10.66