er text-xs"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon text-token-text-tertiary hover:text-token-text-primary"><path d="M8.03003 11.0291C8.28994 10.7698 8.71102 10.7703 8.97046 11.0301C9.22989 11.2901 9.22945 11.7111 8.96948 11.9706L5.26733 15.6649H8.99976L9.13354 15.6786C9.43674 15.7404 9.66476 16.0085 9.66479 16.3299C9.66479 16.6514 9.43675 16.9194 9.13354 16.9813L8.99976 16.995H3.65991C3.29264 16.995 2.99487 16.6972 2.99487 16.3299V10.9998C2.99495 10.6326 3.29269 10.3348 3.65991 10.3348C4.02713 10.3348 4.32488 10.6326 4.32495 10.9998V14.7264L8.03003 11.0291ZM16.9949 8.99985C16.9949 9.36712 16.6971 9.66489 16.3298 9.66489C15.9626 9.66483 15.6648 9.36708 15.6648 8.99985V5.26743L11.9705 8.96957C11.711 9.22954 11.29 9.22998 11.03 8.97055C10.7702 8.71111 10.7697 8.29004 11.0291 8.03012L14.7263 4.32504H10.9998C10.6326 4.32494 10.3347 4.02721 10.3347 3.66C10.3347 3.2928 10.6326 2.99506 10.9998 2.99496H16.3298L16.4636 3.00864C16.7668 3.07053 16.9949 3.33854 16.9949 3.66V8.99985Z"></path></svg></button></span></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary" style="height: 350px;"><img class="my-1 max-h-full max-w-full object-contain" alt="Output image" width="1580" height="980" src="./placeholder_files/48e2297d-528c-4207-8b57-a82b1f420e12"></div><div></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="0ffabbcc-43e3-40d8-840f-a41d34e66115" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-thinking"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="171">Έτοιμο το γράφημα σύγκρισης παραγωγικότητας (ΑΕΠ ανά ώρα εργασίας, USD PPP, 2023) για <strong data-start="86" data-end="135">Ελλάδα, Πορτογαλία, Ισπανία, Γαλλία, Γερμανία</strong>. Τα στοιχεία δείχνουν ενδεικτικά:</p>
<ul data-start="172" data-end="312">
<li data-start="172" data-end="190">
<p data-start="174" data-end="190"><strong data-start="174" data-end="188">Ελλάδα ~45</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="191" data-end="209">
<p data-start="193" data-end="209">Πορτογαλία ~59</p>
</li>
<li data-start="210" data-end="225">
<p data-start="212" data-end="225">Ισπανία ~73</p>
</li>
<li data-start="226" data-end="240">
<p data-start="228" data-end="240">Γαλλία ~88</p>
</li>
<li data-start="241" data-end="312">
<p data-start="243" data-end="312">Γερμανία ~94 (USD ανά ώρα, PPP) <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_countries_by_labour_productivity" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_countries_by_labour_productivity" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">Wikipedia</span><span class="-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]">+1</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="314" data-end="476">Θες να προσθέσω και <strong data-start="334" data-end="352">μέσο όρο ΕΕ-27</strong> (Eurostat, δείκτης ΕΕ=100) και να σου βγάλω δεύτερο γράφημα με <strong data-start="416" data-end="427">δείκτες</strong> αντί για δολάρια για πιο «ευρωπαϊκή» απεικόνιση;</p>

<p data-start="517" data-end="556" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node=""><span class="align-middle" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Coding Citation" class="rounded-xl px-1 bg-token-interactive-bg-tertiary-press text-token-text-secondary hover:text-token-text-inverted hover:bg-token-interactive-bg-primary-selected"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-sm"><path d="M12.0394 5.92117C12.451 6.12699 12.6179 6.62755 12.412 7.0392L9.07871 13.7059C8.87289 14.1175 8.37232 14.2844 7.96068 14.0785C7.54903 13.8727 7.38217 13.3722 7.588 12.9605L10.9213 6.29385C11.1272 5.8822 11.6277 5.71534 12.0394 5.92117ZM5.50002 5.99986C5.86821 6.276 5.94283 6.79833 5.66669 7.16652L3.54169 9.99986L5.66669 12.8332C5.94283 13.2014 5.86821 13.7237 5.50002 13.9999C5.13183 14.276 4.6095 14.2014 4.33335 13.8332L1.83335 10.4999C1.61113 10.2036 1.61113 9.79615 1.83335 9.49986L4.33335 6.16652C4.6095 5.79833 5.13183 5.72371 5.50002 5.99986ZM14.5 5.99986C14.8682 5.72371 15.3905 5.79833 15.6667 6.16652L18.1667 9.49986C18.3889 9.79615 18.3889 10.2036 18.1667 10.4999L15.6667 13.8332C15.3905 14.2014 14.8682 14.276 14.5 13.9999C14.1318 13.7237 14.0572 13.2014 14.3334 12.8332L16.4584 9.99986L14.3334 7.16652C14.0572 6.79833 14.1318 6.276 14.5 5.99986Z"></path></svg></button></span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within