0 HP motor and 250 kg load capacity doesn’t really compare to the bigger (7-seat) RIB boats in many respects. But there <em data-start="185" data-end="190">are</em> trade-offs, and knowing them gives you advantages if you position your product right. Let’s break it down.</p>
<hr data-start="299" data-end="302">
<h2 data-start="304" data-end="352">🔍 Comparison: Your Dinghy vs Big 7-Seat RIBs</h2>
<div class="_tableContainer_1rjym_1"><div tabindex="-1" class="group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse"><table data-start="354" data-end="1286" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="354" data-end="415"><tr data-start="354" data-end="415"><th data-start="354" data-end="364" data-col-size="sm">Feature</th><th data-start="364" data-end="382" data-col-size="md">Big 7-Seat RIBs</th><th data-start="382" data-end="415" data-col-size="md">Your Dinghy (≈ 10 HP, 250 kg)</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="430" data-end="1286"><tr data-start="430" data-end="529"><td data-start="430" data-end="455" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="432" data-end="454">Passenger capacity</strong></td><td data-start="455" data-end="499" data-col-size="md">7+ people comfortably (plus lots of gear)</td><td data-start="499" data-end="529" data-col-size="md">2-3 people max (with gear)</td></tr><tr data-start="530" data-end="706"><td data-start="530" data-end="550" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="532" data-end="549">Speed &amp; power</strong></td><td data-start="550" data-end="654" data-col-size="md">Much higher top speed, plane easily under high HP (100-300+ HP) <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a href="https://powerboatandrib.com/reviews/atlantic-ribs-7-6m/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://powerboatandrib.com/reviews/atlantic-ribs-7-6m/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">Powerboat and RIB</span><span class="-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]">+2</span></span><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between absolute" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateX(10%);"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">ribcraft.com</span><span class="-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]">+2</span></span></span></a></span></span></td><td data-start="654" data-end="706" data-col-size="md">Slow to moderate speed, limited in rougher water</td></tr><tr data-start="707" data-end="840"><td data-start="707" data-end="731" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="709" data-end="730">Range &amp; endurance</strong></td><td data-start="731" data-end="791" data-col-size="md">Can go far from shore, handle waves &amp; rough waters better</td><td data-start="791" data-end="840" data-col-size="md">Best near shore, calm conditions, short trips</td></tr><tr data-start="841" data-end="1004"><td data-start="841" data-end="855" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="843" data-end="854">Comfort</strong></td><td data-start="855" data-end="921" data-col-size="md">More spacious, better seating, more amenities, more stable ride</td><td data-start="921" data-end="1004" data-col-size="md">Very basic, less shielding from waves/wind, likely more spashing and discomfort</td></tr><tr data-start="1005" data-end="1115"><td data-start="1005" data-end="1016" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1007" data-end="1015">Cost</strong></td><td data-start="1016" data-end="1073" data-col-size="md">Much more expensive to buy, maintain, fuel (or charge)</td><td data-start="1073" data-end="1115" data-col-size="md">Much cheaper investment &amp; running cost</td></tr><tr data-start="1116" data-end="1286"><td data-start="1116" data-end="1154" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1118" data-end="1153">Accessibility &amp; maneuverability</strong></td><td data-start="1154" data-end="1208" data-col-size="md">Harder to get licenses, equipment, dock, fuel, etc.</td><td data-start="1208" data-end="1286" data-col-size="md">Easier to deploy, simpler operations, fewer regulatory/operational burdens</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky h-0 select-none end-(--thread-content-margin) self-end"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end" style="height: 32.8906px;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Copy table" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10.667V13.5C3.16504 14.211 3.16593 14.7044 3.19727 15.0879C3.22797 15.4636 3.28473 15.675 3.36524 15.833L3.43555 15.959C3.61186 16.2466 3.86474 16.4807 4.16699 16.6348L4.29688 16.6914C4.44063 16.7428 4.63025 16.7797 4.91211 16.8027C5.29563 16.8341 5.78896 16.835 6.5 16.835H9.33301C10.0439 16.835 10.5374 16.8341 10.9209 16.8027C11.2965 16.772 11.508 16.7152 11.666 16.6348L11.793 16.5645C12.0804 16.3881 12.3148 16.1351 12.4688 15.833L12.5244 15.7031C12.5759 15.5594 12.6137 15.3698 12.6367 15.0879C12.6681 14.7044 12.668 14.211 12.668 13.5V10.667ZM13.998 12.665C14.4528 12.6634 14.8011 12.6602 15.0879 12.6367C15.4635 12.606 15.675 12.5492 15.833 12.4688L15.959 12.3975C16.2466 12.2211 16.48