6.0596C2.7813 15.931 2.80736 15.7796 2.83117 15.6367L3.2296 13.2432L3.36437 12.4785C3.40893 12.2616 3.45789 12.0745 3.52453 11.8926L3.6173 11.6621C3.71685 11.4352 3.83766 11.2176 3.97765 11.0127L4.15343 10.7783C4.34386 10.5462 4.58164 10.312 4.90538 9.98829L11.1964 3.6963L11.3312 3.56837ZM5.84581 10.9287C5.49664 11.2779 5.31252 11.4634 5.18663 11.6162L5.07531 11.7627C4.98188 11.8995 4.90151 12.0448 4.83507 12.1963L4.77355 12.3506C4.73321 12.4607 4.70242 12.5761 4.66808 12.7451L4.54113 13.4619L4.14269 15.8555L4.14171 15.8574H4.14464L6.5382 15.458L7.25499 15.332C7.424 15.2977 7.5394 15.2669 7.64953 15.2266L7.80285 15.165C7.95455 15.0986 8.09947 15.0174 8.23644 14.9238L8.3839 14.8135C8.53668 14.6876 8.72225 14.5035 9.0714 14.1543L14.0587 9.16602L10.8331 5.94044L5.84581 10.9287ZM15.3634 4.63673C14.5281 3.80141 13.2057 3.74938 12.3097 4.48048L12.1368 4.63673L11.7735 5.00001L15.0001 8.22559L15.3634 7.86329L15.5196 7.68946C16.2015 6.85326 16.2015 5.64676 15.5196 4.81056L15.3634 4.63673Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div></article><article class="text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]" tabindex="-1" dir="auto" data-turn-id="b1e43e79-3875-4e09-9fff-4c55f3dad69d" data-testid="conversation-turn-52" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="assistant"><h6 class="sr-only">ChatGPT said:</h6><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] thread-sm:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] thread-lg:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] thread-lg:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn" tabindex="-1"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="4c3af012-2786-4e3e-bc20-62adecbd3f9f" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-instant"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="265">Sounds like a solid middle ground — a 4-5 person RIB gives you more revenue potential without the huge costs and hassles of a big 7+ seater. Let’s map out what you need, what trade-offs are, and what the ideal build looks like so you get the most bang for the buck.</p>
<hr data-start="267" data-end="270">
<h2 data-start="272" data-end="316">⚙️ What size &amp; specs for a 4-5 person RIB</h2>
<p data-start="318" data-end="386">Here are guidelines to help pick a RIB that carries 4-5 people well:</p>
<div class="_tableContainer_1rjym_1"><div tabindex="-1" class="group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse"><table data-start="388" data-end="1167" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="388" data-end="414"><tr data-start="388" data-end="414"><th data-start="388" data-end="395" data-col-size="sm">Spec</th><th data-start="395" data-end="414" data-col-size="lg">What to aim for</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="425" data-end="1167"><tr data-start="425" data-end="523"><td data-start="425" data-end="444" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="427" data-end="443">Length (LOA)</strong></td><td data-start="444" data-end="523" data-col-size="lg">~ 4.5–5.5 meters (≈ 14.8–18 ft) — enough room for 4-5 plus gear comfortably</td></tr><tr data-start="524" data-end="623"><td data-start="524" data-end="543" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="526" data-end="542">Beam (width)</strong></td><td data-start="543" data-end="623" data-col-size="lg">Wide enough (≈ 1.8–2.2 m) so it doesn’t feel cramped or unstable when loaded</td></tr><tr data-start="624" data-end="753"><td data-start="624" data-end="660" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="626" data-end="659">Weight rating / Load capacity</strong></td><td data-start="660" data-end="753" data-col-size="lg">At least the combined weight of 4-5 people + gear + fuel/battery (~ 350-500 kg depending)</td></tr><tr data-start="754" data-end="879"><td data-start="754" data-end="772" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="756" data-end="771">Hull design</strong></td><td data-start="772" data-end="879" data-col-size="lg">Deep V or semi-V-shape helps with waves; lightweight but reinforced material (hypalon, PVC, fiberglass)</td></tr><tr data-start="880" data-end="1004"><td data-start="880" data-end="899" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="882" data-end="898">Engine power</strong></td><td data-start="899" data-end="1004" data-col-size="lg">For good speed &amp; handling, you’ll likely need something like 20-40 HP (petrol or electric equivalent)</td></tr><tr data-start="1005" data-end="1167"><td data-start="1005" data-end="1030" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1007" data-end="1029">Electric vs Petrol</strong></td><td data-start="1030" data-end="1167" data-col-size="lg">Electric gives eco appeal, quietness; petrol gives range &amp; speed. Could do hybrid or a high-capacity electric system if budget allows</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky h-0 select-none end-(--thread-content-margin) self-end"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end" style="height: 32.8906px;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Copy table" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10.667V13.5C3.16504 14.211 3.16593 14.7044 3.19727 15.0879C3.22797 15.4636 3.28473 15.675 3.36524 15.833L3.43555 15.959C3.61186 16.2466 3.86474 16.4807 4.16699 16.6348L4.29688 16.6914C4.44063 16.7428 4.63025 16.7797 4.91211 16.8027C5.29563 16.8341 5.78896 16.835 6.5 16.835H9.33301C10.0439 16.835 10.5374 16.8341 10.9209 16.8027C11.2965 16.772 11.508 16.7152 11.666 16.6348L11.793 16.5645C12.0804 16.3881 12.3148 16.1351 12.4688 15.833L12.5244 15.7031C12.5759 15.5594 