13.5V10.667C1.83496 9.978 1.83432 9.42091 1.87109 8.9707C1.90851 8.5127 1.98772 8.10625 2.17969 7.72949L2.30176 7.51172C2.60586 7.0159 3.04236 6.6122 3.56348 6.34668L3.70606 6.28027C4.04237 6.136 4.40303 6.07083 4.80371 6.03809C5.14051 6.01057 5.53708 6.00551 6.00391 6.00391C6.00551 5.53708 6.01057 5.14051 6.03809 4.80371C6.0755 4.34588 6.15483 3.94012 6.34668 3.56348L6.46875 3.34473C6.77282 2.84912 7.20856 2.44514 7.72949 2.17969L7.87207 2.11328C8.20855 1.96886 8.56979 1.90385 8.9707 1.87109C9.42091 1.83432 9.978 1.83496 10.667 1.83496H13.5C14.1891 1.83496 14.746 1.83431 15.1963 1.87109C15.6541 1.90851 16.0599 1.98788 16.4365 2.17969L16.6553 2.30176C17.151 2.60585 17.5548 3.04244 17.8203 3.56348L17.8867 3.70606C18.031 4.04235 18.0962 4.40306 18.1289 4.80371C18.1657 5.25395 18.165 5.81091 18.165 6.5V9.33301Z"></path></svg></button></span></div></div></div></div>
<hr data-start="1169" data-end="1172">
<h2 data-start="1174" data-end="1219">💡 Advantages &amp; costs for a 4-5 person RIB</h2>
<p data-start="1221" data-end="1230"><strong data-start="1221" data-end="1230">Pros:</strong></p>
<ul data-start="1231" data-end="1480">
<li data-start="1231" data-end="1282">
<p data-start="1233" data-end="1282">More guests per trip = more revenue per outing.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1283" data-end="1344">
<p data-start="1285" data-end="1344">Still more manageable/durable than big 7-10 person boats.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1345" data-end="1431">
<p data-start="1347" data-end="1431">Flexible: private tours, cave-hopping, snorkeling, sunset rides with small groups.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1432" data-end="1480">
<p data-start="1434" data-end="1480">More premium feeling than a 2-3 person dinghy.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1482" data-end="1505"><strong data-start="1482" data-end="1505">Trade-offs / Costs:</strong></p>
<ul data-start="1506" data-end="1800">
<li data-start="1506" data-end="1550">
<p data-start="1508" data-end="1550">Higher purchase price than small dinghy.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1551" data-end="1640">
<p data-start="1553" data-end="1640">Increased operating costs: fuel (if petrol), maintenance, larger battery if electric.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1641" data-end="1722">
<p data-start="1643" data-end="1722">More complicated licensing, registration, possibly safety equipment required.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1723" data-end="1800">
<p data-start="1725" data-end="1800">Need more storage and docking infrastructure; potentially higher insurance.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1802" data-end="1805">
<h2 data-start="1807" data-end="1857">🚀 Strategy for launching with a 4-5 person RIB</h2>
<ol data-start="1859" data-end="2627">
<li data-start="1859" data-end="1968">
<p data-start="1862" data-end="1968"><strong data-start="1862" data-end="1880">Choose a model</strong> that fits specs above, preferably used to reduce upfront cost, but in good condition.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1970" data-end="2165">
<p data-start="1973" data-end="2000"><strong data-start="1973" data-end="1997">Decide on propulsion</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="2004" data-end="2165">
<li data-start="2004" data-end="2099">
<p data-start="2006" data-end="2099">If electric, ensure you have enough battery capacity for your trip profiles (speed + range)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2103" data-end="2165">
<p data-start="2105" data-end="2165">If petrol, plan fuel infrastructure + environmental impact</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="2167" data-end="2293">
<p data-start="2170" data-end="2293"><strong data-start="2170" data-end="2189">Compute pricing</strong>: what will you charge per person/trip, capacity utilization (e.g. 4 people × €X), how many trips/day.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2295" data-end="2395">
<p data-start="2298" data-end="2395"><strong data-start="2298" data-end="2327">Permit &amp; safety equipment</strong>: Life jackets, radios, registration, local rules for small boats.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2397" data-end="2507">
<p data-start="2400" data-end="2507"><strong data-start="2400" data-end="2421">Unique value-adds</strong>: Underwater video, photography, snorkeling, maybe small refreshments, storytelling.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2509" data-end="2627">
<p data-start="2512" data-end="2627"><strong data-start="2512" data-end="2525">Test runs</strong>: Launch with friends/guests to measure trip times, speed, handling so you can tweak the experience.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="2629" data-end="2632">
<p data-start="2634" data-end="2825">If you want, I can pull up <strong data-start="2661" data-end="2682">models and prices</strong> for decent 4-5 person RIBs (both petrol &amp; electric options) that ship to Greece, plus cost estimates, so you can choose one without surprises?</p>
</div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10.667V13.5C3.16504 14.211 3.16593 14.7044 3.19727 15.0879C3.22797 15.4636 3.28473 15.675 3.36524 15.833L3.43555 15.959C3.61186 16.2466 3.86474 16.4807 4.16699 16.6348L4.29688 16.6914C4.44063 16.7428 4.63025 16.7797 4.91211 16.8027C5.29563 16.8341 5.78896 16.835 6.5 16.835H9.33301C10.