7L8.47065 16.2207C8.21095 16.4804 7.78895 16.4804 7.52925 16.2207C7.26955 15.961 7.26955 15.539 7.52925 15.2793L12.8085 10L7.52925 4.7207L7.44429 4.61621C7.27378 4.35808 7.30198 4.00657 7.52925 3.7793Z"></path></svg></div></button></div></div></div></div>
<p data-start="312" data-end="363">Here’s a breakdown of some good ones from the list:</p>
<ul data-start="365" data-end="1191">
<li data-start="365" data-end="475">
<p data-start="367" data-end="475"><strong data-start="367" data-end="408"><span class="entity-underline hover:entity-accent inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Underwater Thruster IPX8 2.4 kgf</span></span></strong>: Small, waterproof, good for light thrust. Good for prototyping.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="476" data-end="599">
<p data-start="478" data-end="599"><strong data-start="478" data-end="519"><span class="entity-underline hover:entity-accent inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">14.2 kg Thrust Brushless Thruster</span></span></strong>: Much more powerful. If you want better push and not rely only on the paddle.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="600" data-end="686">
<p data-start="602" data-end="686"><strong data-start="602" data-end="643"><span class="entity-underline hover:entity-accent inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">36 lbs 12 V Thruster</span></span></strong>: Heavy-duty. Could power one arm nicely.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="687" data-end="770">
<p data-start="689" data-end="770"><strong data-start="689" data-end="730"><span class="entity-underline hover:entity-accent inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Aqua Marina BlueDrive K Motor</span></span></strong>: Brand motor, more quality assurance.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="771" data-end="872">
<p data-start="773" data-end="872"><strong data-start="773" data-end="814"><span class="entity-underline hover:entity-accent inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">IP67 Push‑Button Switch 15 A</span></span></strong>: Waterproof switch for turning motors on/off or low/hi.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="873" data-end="979">
<p data-start="875" data-end="979"><strong data-start="875" data-end="916"><span class="entity-underline hover:entity-accent inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">55 lbs Savage Gear Thruster</span></span></strong>: Strong unit, maybe overkill for prototype but good to test.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="980" data-end="1090">
<p data-start="982" data-end="1090"><strong data-start="982" data-end="1023"><span class="entity-underline hover:entity-accent inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Marine Wiring Kit</span></span></strong>: Cables, connectors, breaker – needed to wire everything safely.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1091" data-end="1191">
<p data-start="1093" data-end="1191"><strong data-start="1093" data-end="1134"><span class="entity-underline hover:entity-accent inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Talamex Battery Switch Panel</span></span></strong>: Useful for selecting battery/motor + safety killswitch.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1193" data-end="1196">
<h2 data-start="1198" data-end="1242">⚙️ Other components &amp; sources from search</h2>
<ul data-start="1244" data-end="1942">
<li data-start="1244" data-end="1594">
<p data-start="1246" data-end="1266"><strong data-start="1246" data-end="1263">Battery packs</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="1269" data-end="1594">
<li data-start="1269" data-end="1366">
<p data-start="1271" data-end="1366">LiFePO4 marine batteries are lighter, safer, long life. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a href="https://www.epochbatteries.com/collections/lithium-marine-batteries?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://www.epochbatteries.com/collections/lithium-marine-batteries?utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">epochbatteries.com</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1369" data-end="1476">
<p data-start="1371" data-end="1476">Waterproof battery packs 12V with 50 Ah capacity are available. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a href="https://www.mariner-sails.com/fpv-power-50ah-v3-waterproof-ip67-rated-lithium-ba.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://www.mariner-sails.com/fpv-power-50ah-v3-waterproof-ip67-rated-lithium-ba.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">mariner-sails.com</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1479" data-end="1594">
<p data-start="1481" data-end="1594">Also high-capacity marine battery like 200 Ah LiFePO4 for more runtime. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a href="https://www.vmaxtanks.com/marine200ah?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://www.vmaxtanks.com/marine200ah?utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">vmaxtanks.com</span><span class="-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]">+1</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="1596" data-end="1743">
<p data-start="1598" data-end="1623"><strong data-start="1598" data-end="1620">Switches / Control</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="1626" data-end="1743">
<li data-start="1626" data-end="1743">
<p data-start="1628" data-end="1743">Marine-grade rocker/toggle switches waterproof for turning motors on/off. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a href="https://www.hodgesmarine.com/boat-accessories/trolling-motors/trolling-motor-accessories.html?srsltid=AfmBOoqD_52d92dKrPBZMgR9LxJwVmnbXZEd9vYu8rVa356qENV_Tqrz&amp;utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://www.hodgesmarine.com/boat-accessories/trolling-motors/trolling-motor-accessories.html?srsltid=AfmBOoqD_52d92dKrPBZMgR9LxJwVmnbXZEd9vYu8rVa356qENV_Tqrz&amp;utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">hodgesmarine.com</span><span class="-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]">+2</span></span><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between absolute" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateX(10%);"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">T-H Marine Supplies</span><span class="-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]">+2</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="1745" data-end="1942">
<p data-start="1747" data-end="1942"><strong data-start="1747" data-end="1778">Waterproof housings &amp; seals</strong>: you’ll need waterproof cable glands for shafts of propellers or motors that penetrate the hull. (Not listed, but standard marine hardware suppliers carry them.)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1944" data-end="1947">
<h2 data-start="1949" data-end="2005">🛠 How to assemble prototype: suggested configuration</h2>
<p data-start="2007" data-end="2042">Here’s how the parts come together:</p>
<div class="_tableContainer_1rjym_1"><div tabindex="-1" class="group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse"><table data-start="2044" data-end="2726" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="2044" data-end="2117"><tr data-start="2044" data-end="2117"><th data-start="2044" data-end="2056" data-col-size="md">Component</th><th data-start="2056" data-end="2117" data-col-size="md">Purpose in your “P-shape paddle + twin motor ends” system</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="2128" data-end="2726"><tr data-start="2128" data-end="2267"><td data-start="2128" data-end="2180" data-col-size="md">Two thrusters (mid-power, e.g., 14 kgf or ~36 lb)</td><td data-start="2180" data-end="2267" data-col-size="md">These mount at the ends of the paddle-arms; continuous submersion, generate thrust.</td></tr><tr data-start="2268" data-end="2396"><td data-start="2268" data-end="2292" data-col-size="md">Wiring kit + switches</td><td data-start="2292" data-end="2396" data-col-size="md">Each thruster has its own circuit, controlled from handle-region paddle bar via waterproof switches.</td></tr><tr data-start="2397" data-end="2506"><td data-start="2397" data-end="2425" data-col-size="md">Battery pack (12V or 24V)</td><td data-start="2425" data-end="2506" data-col-size="md">Power source; enough Ah to run both motors for reasonable time (e.g. 1 hour).</td></tr><tr data-start="2507" data-end="2625"><td data-start="2507" data-end="2540" data-col-size="md">Paddle frame &amp; mount structure</td><td data-start="2540" data-end="2625" data-col-size="md">Aluminium or composite; holds paddle arms rigid, anchors motors, supports wiring.</td></tr><tr data-start="2626" data-end="2726"><td data-start="2626" data-end="2658" data-col-size="md">Sealing and waterproof joints</td><td data-start="2658" data-end="2726" data-col-size="md">For shafts, wiring passes, motor mounts – prevent water ingress.</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky h-0 select-none end-(--thread-content-margin) self-end"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end" style="height: 48.8906px;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Copy table" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10.667V13.5C3.16504 14.211 3.16593 14.7044 3.19727 15.0879C3.22797 15.4636 3.28473 15.675 3.36524 15.833L3.43555 15.959C3.61186 16.2466 3.86474 16.4807 4.16699 16.6348L4.29688 16.6914C4.44063 16.7428 4.63025 16.7797 4.91211 16.8027C5.29563 16.8341 5.78896 16.835 6.5 16.835H9.33301C10.0439 16.835 10.5374 16.8341 10.9209 16.8027C11.2965 16.772 11.508 16.7152 11.666 16.6348L11.793 16.5645C12.0804 16.3881 12.3148 16.1351 12.4688 15.833L12.5244 15.7031C12.5759 15.5594 12.6137 15.3698 12.6367 15.0879C12.6681 14.7044 12.668 14.211 12.668 13.5V10.667ZM13.998 12.665C14.4528 12.6634 14.8011 12.6602 15.0879 12.6367C15.4635 12.606 15.675 12.5492 15.833 12.4688L15.959 12.3975C16.2466 12.2211 16.4808 11.9682 16.6348 11.666L16.6914 11.5361C16.7428 11.3924 16.7797 11.2026 16.8027 10.9209C16.8341 10.5374 16.835 10.0439 16.835 9.33301V6.5C16.835 5.78896 16.8341 5.29563 16.8027 4.91211C16.7797 4.63025 16.7428 4.44063 16.6914 4.29688L16.6348 4.16699C16.4807 3.86474 16