-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]" tabindex="-1" dir="auto" data-turn-id="d091570d-a392-4589-babf-908209c237bc" data-testid="conversation-turn-106" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="assistant"><h6 class="sr-only">ChatGPT said:</h6><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] thread-sm:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] thread-lg:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] thread-lg:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn" tabindex="-1"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="5bde5154-d1bf-425d-8d20-54eb8733a497" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-instant"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="131">Cool, έκανα καμιά έρευνα για Ελλάδα / Ευρώπη + λίγα προϊόντα που βρίσκονται διαθέσιμα — έτσι έχεις πιο ρεαλιστική εικόνα κόστους.</p>
<hr data-start="133" data-end="136">
<h2 data-start="138" data-end="166">🔍 Τι βρήκα στην αγορά EU</h2>
<div class="_tableContainer_1rjym_1"><div tabindex="-1" class="group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse"><table data-start="168" data-end="1551" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="168" data-end="223"><tr data-start="168" data-end="223"><th data-start="168" data-end="182" data-col-size="md">Αντικείμενο</th><th data-start="182" data-end="207" data-col-size="lg">Τιμές / χαρακτηριστικά</th><th data-start="207" data-end="223" data-col-size="lg">Παρατηρήσεις</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="238" data-end="1551"><tr data-start="238" data-end="539"><td data-start="238" data-end="266" data-col-size="md"><strong data-start="240" data-end="265">JetThruster Micro Kit</strong></td><td data-start="266" data-end="442" data-col-size="lg">Δεν βρήκα ξεκάθαρη τιμή για ναυτιλιακή χρήση, αλλά είναι πακέτο που περιλαμβάνει pump unit + joystick + καλώδια, για μικρά σκάφη ~30 ft <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a href="https://www.jetthruster.com/webshop/Jet-Thruster-Micro-for-Small-boats-p521079365?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://www.jetthruster.com/webshop/Jet-Thruster-Micro-for-Small-boats-p521079365?utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">jetthruster.com</span></span></span></a></span></span></td><td data-start="442" data-end="539" data-col-size="lg">Πολύ μεγαλύτερο / πιο δυνατό απ’ όσο χρειάζεσαι, πιθανόν overkill για κουπί-κινητήρα μοντέλο.</td></tr><tr data-start="540" data-end="783"><td data-start="540" data-end="582" data-col-size="md"><strong data-start="542" data-end="581">WattCycle 12V 100Ah LiFePO4 Battery</strong></td><td data-start="582" data-end="693" data-col-size="lg">~ <strong data-start="586" data-end="597">€178,59</strong> για βασικό μοντέλο trolling motor battery 100Ah LiFePO4. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a href="https://eu.wattcycle.com/collections/trolling-motor-batteries?srsltid=AfmBOoqFsuXff7wAbLm-SYZ4xWvjm_7h4Kgh2sVcx1nZUfdMCtNkuNkF&amp;utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://eu.wattcycle.com/collections/trolling-motor-batteries?srsltid=AfmBOoqFsuXff7wAbLm-SYZ4xWvjm_7h4Kgh2sVcx1nZUfdMCtNkuNkF&amp;utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">Wattcycle-Europe</span></span></span></a></span></span></td><td data-start="693" data-end="783" data-col-size="lg">Καλή τιμή για μπαταρία - θα είναι αρκετή για μικρή ώρα χρήσης με δύο “μοτέρ στα άκρα”.</td></tr><tr data-start="784" data-end="969"><td data-start="784" data-end="820" data-col-size="md"><strong data-start="786" data-end="819">Renogy Core 12V 100Ah LiFePO4</strong></td><td data-start="820" data-end="899" data-col-size="lg">~ <strong data-start="824" data-end="835">€230,99</strong> στο EU website (έκπτωση) <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a href="https://eu.renogy.com/products/core-12v-100ah-trolling-motor-group-24-lifepo4-battery-w-bluetooth?srsltid=AfmBOooxzaIkzOaCeEESQB8-xhz8LAxk7ykv27EYHqnbUEnSZoarqRdT&amp;utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://eu.renogy.com/products/core-12v-100ah-trolling-motor-group-24-lifepo4-battery-w-bluetooth?srsltid=AfmBOooxzaIkzOaCeEESQB8-xhz8LAxk7ykv27EYHqnbUEnSZoarqRdT&amp;utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">Renogy EU</span></span></span></a></span></span></td><td data-start="899" data-end="969" data-col-size="lg">Εναλλακτική μπαταρία, ελαφρώς πιο ακριβή αλλά επώνυμη &amp; αξιόπιστη.</td></tr><tr data-start="970" data-end="1275"><td data-start="970" data-end="1007" data-col-size="md"><strong data-start="972" data-end="1006">Marine battery / thruster sets</strong></td><td data-start="1007" data-end="1164" data-col-size="lg">Υπάρχουν thrusters μικρής ισχύος σε καταστήματα “Underwater Thruster / ApisQueen” (~US$200-400) για 30-40 lbs ώθηση. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a href="https://www.underwaterthruster.com/collections/underwater-thruster-set-1?srsltid=AfmBOoogO0xU1-SRemvMRMQ7uWC5leCBuehwJR0eo2hmGSf34qCh4C2l&amp;utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://www.underwaterthruster.com/collections/underwater-thruster-set-1?srsltid=AfmBOoogO0xU1-SRemvMRMQ7uWC5leCBuehwJR0eo2hmGSf34qCh4C2l&amp;utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">Underwater Thruster</span></span></span></a></span></span></td><td data-start="1164" data-end="1275" data-col-size="lg">Το μετατρέπεις εύκολα σε τιμές Ευρώπης με μεταφορικά + τελωνείο, αλλά είναι κοντά στο budget για πρωτότυπο.</td></tr><tr data-start="1276" data-end="1551"><td data-start="1276" data-end="1334" data-col-size="md"><strong data-start="1278" data-end="1333">Bow Thruster / Stern Thruster (Vetus BOW6012D 3 kW)</strong></td><td data-start="1334" data-end="1439" data-col-size="lg">περίπου <strong data-start="1344" data-end="1357">€1.495,76</strong> (χονδρική) για ισχυρό thruster 3 kW / 650N <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a href="https://www.svb24.com/en/vetus-bow6012d-bow-thruster-stern-thruster-12-v-3-kw-650n.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://www.svb24.com/en/vetus-bow6012d-bow-thruster-stern-thruster-12-v-3-kw-650n.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">SVB GmbH</span></span></span></a></span></span></td><td data-start="1439" data-end="1551" data-col-size="lg">