"icon"><path d="M7.52925 3.7793C7.75652 3.55203 8.10803 3.52383 8.36616 3.69434L8.47065 3.7793L14.2207 9.5293C14.4804 9.789 14.4804 10.211 14.2207 10.4707L8.47065 16.2207C8.21095 16.4804 7.78895 16.4804 7.52925 16.2207C7.26955 15.961 7.26955 15.539 7.52925 15.2793L12.8085 10L7.52925 4.7207L7.44429 4.61621C7.27378 4.35808 7.30198 4.00657 7.52925 3.7793Z"></path></svg></div></button></div></div></div></div>
<p data-start="1737" data-end="1760">Here are the top picks:</p>
<ul data-start="1762" data-end="2571">
<li data-start="1762" data-end="1889">
<p data-start="1764" data-end="1889"><strong data-start="1764" data-end="1805"><span class="entity-underline hover:entity-accent inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">EcoWorthy 12V 100Ah LiFePO4 Battery</span></span></strong>: Καλή χωρητικότητα, με Bluetooth και προστασία από χαμηλές θερμοκρασίες. (~ €372)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1890" data-end="1981">
<p data-start="1892" data-end="1981"><strong data-start="1892" data-end="1933"><span class="entity-underline hover:entity-accent inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Renogy Core Mini 12.8V 100Ah LiFePO4 Battery</span></span></strong>: πιο compact, αρκετά αξιόπιστο brand (~ €208)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1982" data-end="2095">
<p data-start="1984" data-end="2095"><strong data-start="1984" data-end="2025"><span class="entity-underline hover:entity-accent inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">WattCycle 12V 200Ah Deep‑Cycle Battery</span></span></strong>: πιο μεγάλη χωρητικότητα → περισσότερος χρόνος λειτουργίας (~ €380)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2096" data-end="2181">
<p data-start="2098" data-end="2181"><strong data-start="2098" data-end="2139"><span class="entity-underline hover:entity-accent inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">LiFePO4 12V 50Ah Battery</span></span></strong>: μικρότερη, πιο ελαφριά επιλογή (~ €64)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2182" data-end="2267">
<p data-start="2184" data-end="2267"><strong data-start="2184" data-end="2227"><span class="entity-underline hover:entity-accent inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Mitsuba ‑ 90Ah Marine Starting Battery</span></span></strong>: για πιο απλή ή backup χρήση (~ €131)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2268" data-end="2358">
<p data-start="2270" data-end="2358"><strong data-start="2270" data-end="2313"><span class="entity-underline hover:entity-accent inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Hankook Marine 90Ah Battery</span></span></strong>: μεσαίας τάξης, πιθανώς πιο βαριά (~ €148)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2359" data-end="2448">
<p data-start="2361" data-end="2448"><strong data-start="2361" data-end="2404"><span class="entity-underline hover:entity-accent inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Dolphin 12V 180Ah Marine Battery</span></span></strong>: μεγάλη χωρητικότητα, ακριβότερη (~ €345)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2449" data-end="2571">
<p data-start="2451" data-end="2571"><strong data-start="2451" data-end="2494"><span class="entity-underline hover:entity-accent inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Minn Kota 80‑lb Trolling Motor</span></span></strong>: αυτό δεν είναι μπαταρία, είναι μοτέρ – πολύ ισχυρό και δυνατό (~ €1.400+)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2573" data-end="2576">
<h2 data-start="2578" data-end="2630">💡 Περίπου κόστος πρωτοτύπου στην Ελλάδα / Ευρώπη</h2>
<p data-start="2632" data-end="2659">Λαμβάνοντας υπόψη τι βρήκα:</p>
<ul data-start="2661" data-end="3066">
<li data-start="2661" data-end="2769">
<p data-start="2663" data-end="2769">2 μικρά underwater thrusters ή trolling motors (κάθε άκρη) → <strong data-start="2724" data-end="2737">€200-€500</strong> το καθένα (ανάλογα με ώθηση).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2770" data-end="2842">
<p data-start="2772" data-end="2842">Μια μπαταρία LiFePO4 12V / 100Ah → <strong data-start="2807" data-end="2820">€180-€230</strong> για βασική επιλογή.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2843" data-end="2940">
<p data-start="2845" data-end="2940">Μικρό ηλεκτρικό χειριστήριο / διακόπτης + καλώδια, στεγανοποίηση, σφραγίσματα → <strong data-start="2925" data-end="2937">€50-€150</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2941" data-end="3066">
<p data-start="2943" data-end="3066">Κατασκευή / σκελετός κουπιού με μοτέρ άκρων, υλικά + εργασία → <strong data-start="3006" data-end="3019">€100-€300</strong> αν το κάνεις χειροποίητο ή με μικρό συνεργείο.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="3068" data-end="3219">Άρα συνολικό πρότυπο (prototype) μπορεί να σου κοστίσει περίπου:<br data-start="3132" data-end="3135">
<strong data-start="3135" data-end="3150">€600-€1.200</strong> (παίζει αρκετά οι τιμές με βάση τι εξαρτήματα βρίσκεις φτηνότερα).</p>
<hr data-start="3221" data-end="3224">
<p data-start="3226" data-end="3380">Αν θες, μπορώ να φτιάξω <strong data-start="3250" data-end="3271">συγκριτικό κόστος</strong> για δύο εκδόσεις: “βασικό” πρωτότυπο και “βελτιωμένο επαγγελματικό”-που να μπορεί να νοικιάζεται καθημερινά.</p>
</div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10.667V13.5C3.16504 14.211 3.16593 14.7044 3.19727 15.0879C3.22797 15.4636 3.28473 15.675 3.36524 15.833L3.43555 15.959C3.61186 16.2466 3.86474 16.4807 4.16699 16.6348L4.29688 16.6914C4.44063 16.7428 4.63025 16.7797 4.91211 16.8027C5.29563 16.8341 5.78896 16.835 6.5 16.835H9.33301C10.