var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]" tabindex="-1" dir="auto" data-turn-id="9c7044ee-f0b5-4467-ae25-cad0e81a0879" data-testid="conversation-turn-108" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="assistant"><h6 class="sr-only">ChatGPT said:</h6><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] thread-sm:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] thread-lg:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] thread-lg:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn" tabindex="-1"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="9c7044ee-f0b5-4467-ae25-cad0e81a0879" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-instant"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="74">Got it 👍 Let me give you everything in <strong data-start="40" data-end="51">English</strong> now, clear and simple:</p>
<hr data-start="76" data-end="79">
<h2 data-start="81" data-end="135">🔧 Parts needed for your “P-shaped electric paddle”</h2>
<ol data-start="136" data-end="767">
<li data-start="136" data-end="241">
<p data-start="139" data-end="150"><strong data-start="139" data-end="148">Frame</strong></p>
<ul data-start="154" data-end="241">
<li data-start="154" data-end="199">
<p data-start="156" data-end="199">U/P-shaped bar, aluminum or carbon fiber.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="203" data-end="241">
<p data-start="205" data-end="241">Handle on top, motors at each end.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="243" data-end="397">
<p data-start="246" data-end="270"><strong data-start="246" data-end="268">Motors (Thrusters)</strong></p>
<ul data-start="274" data-end="397">
<li data-start="274" data-end="339">
<p data-start="276" data-end="339">Two small waterproof trolling motors or underwater thrusters.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="343" data-end="397">
<p data-start="345" data-end="397">Each mounted at the paddle ends, always submerged.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="399" data-end="545">
<p data-start="402" data-end="415"><strong data-start="402" data-end="413">Battery</strong></p>
<ul data-start="419" data-end="545">
<li data-start="419" data-end="470">
<p data-start="421" data-end="470">Lithium (LiFePO4) 12V or 24V battery, 50–100Ah.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="474" data-end="545">
<p data-start="476" data-end="545">Either in the paddle handle (smaller) or in the canoe with a cable.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="547" data-end="670">
<p data-start="550" data-end="564"><strong data-start="550" data-end="562">Controls</strong></p>
<ul data-start="568" data-end="670">
<li data-start="568" data-end="620">
<p data-start="570" data-end="620">Waterproof push button or trigger on the handle.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="624" data-end="670">
<p data-start="626" data-end="670">Option for speed levels (low/medium/high).</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="672" data-end="767">
<p data-start="675" data-end="695"><strong data-start="675" data-end="693">Wiring &amp; Seals</strong></p>
<ul data-start="699" data-end="767">
<li data-start="699" data-end="767">
<p data-start="701" data-end="767">Marine-grade cables, waterproof glands, fuse/breaker for safety.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="769" data-end="772">
<h2 data-start="774" data-end="807">💶 Estimated Costs (EU market)</h2>
<ul data-start="809" data-end="1070">
<li data-start="809" data-end="865">
<p data-start="811" data-end="865"><strong data-start="811" data-end="821">Motors</strong> (2x small thrusters) → <strong data-start="845" data-end="863">€200–€500 each</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="866" data-end="957">
<p data-start="868" data-end="957"><strong data-start="868" data-end="879">Battery</strong> (12V, 100Ah LiFePO4) → <strong data-start="903" data-end="916">€180–€230</strong> (good quality Renogy, WattCycle, etc.)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="958" data-end="1004">
<p data-start="960" data-end="1004"><strong data-start="960" data-end="987">Switches, wiring, seals</strong> → <strong data-start="990" data-end="1002">€50–€150</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1005" data-end="1070">
<p data-start="1007" data-end="1070"><strong data-start="1007" data-end="1052">Frame build (aluminum/carbon + machining)</strong> → <strong data-start="1055" data-end="1068">€100–€300</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1072" data-end="1146">👉 Total prototype budget: <strong data-start="1099" data-end="1115">~€600–€1,200</strong> depending on component choice.</p>
<hr data-start="1148" data-end="1151">
<h2 data-start="1153" data-end="1175">⚙️ Development path</h2>
<ul data-start="1176" data-end="1612">
<li data-start="1176" data-end="1353">
<p data-start="1178" data-end="1200"><strong data-start="1178" data-end="1197">Basic prototype</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="1204" data-end="1353">
<li data-start="1204" data-end="1278">
<p data-start="1206" data-end="1278">Use cheaper €65–€150 thrusters, one 12V battery, single on/off switch.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1282" data-end="1327">
<p data-start="1284" data-end="1327">Goal: prove it works, test in calm water.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1331" data-end="1353">
<p data-start="1333" data-end="1353">Budget: ~<strong data-start="1342" data-end="1350">€600</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="1355" data-end="1612">
<p data-start="1357" data-end="1398"><strong data-start="1357" data-end="1381">Professional version</strong> (for rentals):</p>
<ul data-start="1402" data-end="1612">
<li data-start="1402" data-end="1487">
<p data-start="1404" data-end="1487">Stronger motors, higher capacity battery, ergonomic handle, safety cutoff switch.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1491" data-end="1550">
<p data-start="1493" data-end="1550">Needs corrosion-resistant materials + CE certification.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1554" data-end="1612">
<p data-start="1556" data-end="1612">Budget: <strong data-start="1564" data-end="1575">€2,000+</strong> for durable tourist-ready product.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1614" data-end="1617">
<p data-start="1619" data-end="1813" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">So yes ✅ you <em data-start="1632" data-end="1650">can build it now</em> with off-the-shelf parts.<br data-start="1676" data-end="1679">
Would you like me to put together a <strong data-start="1715" data-end="1750">shopping list with direct links</strong> (EU suppliers) so you can actually order the motors + battery?</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10.667V13.5C3.16504 14.211 3.16593 14.7044 3.19727 15.0879C3.22797 15.4636 3.28473 15.675 3.36524 15