<hr data-start="1808" data-end="1811">
<h2 data-start="1813" data-end="1840">⚙️ My Suggested Pairings</h2>
<p data-start="1842" data-end="1945">Here are a few combinations that could work well for the “P-paddle with motors on both ends” prototype:</p>
<div class="_tableContainer_1rjym_1"><div tabindex="-1" class="group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse"><table data-start="1947" data-end="2605" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="1947" data-end="2027"><tr data-start="1947" data-end="2027"><th data-start="1947" data-end="1963" data-col-size="sm">Configuration</th><th data-start="1963" data-end="1975" data-col-size="sm">Thrusters</th><th data-start="1975" data-end="1985" data-col-size="md">Battery</th><th data-start="1985" data-end="2012" data-col-size="md">Expected Power / Runtime</th><th data-start="2012" data-end="2027" data-col-size="sm">Suitability</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="2050" data-end="2605"><tr data-start="2050" data-end="2239"><td data-start="2050" data-end="2080" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="2052" data-end="2079">Low budget / test setup</strong></td><td data-start="2080" data-end="2120" data-col-size="sm">2 × IPX8 2.4 kg thrusters (~€66 each)</td><td data-start="2120" data-end="2150" data-col-size="md">EcoWorthy 12V-100Ah (~€372)</td><td data-start="2150" data-end="2198" data-col-size="md">Light thrust, maybe 30-45 min with small load</td><td data-start="2198" data-end="2239" data-col-size="sm">Good for proof of concept, calm water</td></tr><tr data-start="2240" data-end="2406"><td data-start="2240" data-end="2261" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="2242" data-end="2260">Balanced setup</strong></td><td data-start="2261" data-end="2298" data-col-size="sm">2 × BlueRobotics T200 (~€230 each)</td><td data-start="2298" data-end="2325" data-col-size="md">Renogy 12V-200Ah (~€441)</td><td data-start="2325" data-end="2374" data-col-size="md">Stronger pull, ~1 hour or more with 2-3 people</td><td data-start="2374" data-end="2406" data-col-size="sm">For rentals, more robustness</td></tr><tr data-start="2407" data-end="2605"><td data-start="2407" data-end="2430" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="2409" data-end="2429">High performance</strong></td><td data-start="2430" data-end="2472" data-col-size="sm">2 × CubeMars SW7 / 14.2kg thruster pair</td><td data-start="2472" data-end="2519" data-col-size="md">WattCycle 12V-314Ah or similar large battery</td><td data-start="2519" data-end="2564" data-col-size="md">More thrust, longer runtime, heavier setup</td><td data-start="2564" data-end="2605" data-col-size="sm">Premium use, more investment required</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky h-0 select-none end-(--thread-content-margin) self-end"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end" style="height: 32.8906px;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Copy table" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10.667V13.5C3.16504 14.211 3.16593 14.7044 3.19727 15.0879C3.22797 15.4636 3.28473 15.675 3.36524 15.833L3.43555 15.959C3.61186 16.2466 3.86474 16.4807 4.16699 16.6348L4.29688 16.6914C4.44063 16.7428 4.63025 16.7797 4.91211 16.8027C5.29563 16.8341 5.78896 16.835 6.5 16.835H9.33301C10.0439 16.835 10.5374 16.8341 10.9209 16.8027C11.2965 16.772 11.508 16.7152 11.666 16.6348L11.793 16.5645C12.0804 16.3881 12.3148 16.1351 12.4688 15.833L12.5244 15.7031C12.5759 15.5594 12.