5V10.667C1.83496 9.978 1.83432 9.42091 1.87109 8.9707C1.90851 8.5127 1.98772 8.10625 2.17969 7.72949L2.30176 7.51172C2.60586 7.0159 3.04236 6.6122 3.56348 6.34668L3.70606 6.28027C4.04237 6.136 4.40303 6.07083 4.80371 6.03809C5.14051 6.01057 5.53708 6.00551 6.00391 6.00391C6.00551 5.53708 6.01057 5.14051 6.03809 4.80371C6.0755 4.34588 6.15483 3.94012 6.34668 3.56348L6.46875 3.34473C6.77282 2.84912 7.20856 2.44514 7.72949 2.17969L7.87207 2.11328C8.20855 1.96886 8.56979 1.90385 8.9707 1.87109C9.42091 1.83432 9.978 1.83496 10.667 1.83496H13.5C14.1891 1.83496 14.746 1.83431 15.1963 1.87109C15.6541 1.90851 16.0599 1.98788 16.4365 2.17969L16.6553 2.30176C17.151 2.60585 17.5548 3.04244 17.8203 3.56348L17.8867 3.70606C18.031 4.04235 18.0962 4.40306 18.1289 4.80371C18.1657 5.25395 18.165 5.81091 18.165 6.5V9.33301Z"></path></svg></button></span></div></div></div></div>
<hr data-start="2607" data-end="2610">
<h2 data-start="2612" data-end="2652">⚠️ What to Double-Check Before Buying</h2>
<ul data-start="2654" data-end="3038">
<li data-start="2654" data-end="2745">
<p data-start="2656" data-end="2745">Thrust vs load: ensure thrusters can handle what you want (weight + water drag + gear).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2746" data-end="2833">
<p data-start="2748" data-end="2833">Operating voltage: thrusters and battery voltage must match (or be safe with ESCs).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2834" data-end="2881">
<p data-start="2836" data-end="2881">Waterproof rating and corrosion resistance.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2882" data-end="2972">
<p data-start="2884" data-end="2972">Weight of components and distribution (battery + motors) so your canoe remains stable.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2973" data-end="3038">
<p data-start="2975" data-end="3038">Safety features: fuse, cutoff switch, properly sealed motors.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="3040" data-end="3043">
<p data-start="3045" data-end="3257">If you like, I can put together a <strong data-start="3079" data-end="3118">shopping list + expected total cost</strong> for Greece (including shipping/taxes) for one of the pairings above (e.g. Balanced setup), so you know exactly how much money to allocate.</p>
