761 4.66808 12.7451L4.54113 13.4619L4.14269 15.8555L4.14171 15.8574H4.14464L6.5382 15.458L7.25499 15.332C7.424 15.2977 7.5394 15.2669 7.64953 15.2266L7.80285 15.165C7.95455 15.0986 8.09947 15.0174 8.23644 14.9238L8.3839 14.8135C8.53668 14.6876 8.72225 14.5035 9.0714 14.1543L14.0587 9.16602L10.8331 5.94044L5.84581 10.9287ZM15.3634 4.63673C14.5281 3.80141 13.2057 3.74938 12.3097 4.48048L12.1368 4.63673L11.7735 5.00001L15.0001 8.22559L15.3634 7.86329L15.5196 7.68946C16.2015 6.85326 16.2015 5.64676 15.5196 4.81056L15.3634 4.63673Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div></article><article class="text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]" tabindex="-1" dir="auto" data-turn-id="8c5e9b56-361e-4239-8bc9-fa940d3aeea9" data-testid="conversation-turn-122" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="assistant"><h6 class="sr-only">ChatGPT said:</h6><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] thread-sm:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] thread-lg:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] thread-lg:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn" tabindex="-1"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="8c5e9b56-361e-4239-8bc9-fa940d3aeea9" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-instant"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="104">Yes 🔋 — <strong data-start="9" data-end="40">1 hour minimum battery life</strong> is absolutely the baseline if you want this to work in Corfu.</p>
<p data-start="106" data-end="119">Here’s why:</p>
<ul data-start="120" data-end="352">
<li data-start="120" data-end="196">
<p data-start="122" data-end="196">A typical tourist trip = 45–60 minutes (exploring caves, taking photos).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="197" data-end="274">
<p data-start="199" data-end="274">Anything less → customers worry they’ll get stuck or need to paddle back.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="275" data-end="352">
<p data-start="277" data-end="352">Rentals need buffer (advertise 1 hour, but design for 75–90 min runtime).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="354" data-end="357">
<h2 data-start="359" data-end="393">⚡ Battery Requirement Breakdown</h2>
<ol data-start="395" data-end="902">
<li data-start="395" data-end="539">
<p data-start="398" data-end="424"><strong data-start="398" data-end="422">Power draw per motor</strong></p>
<ul data-start="428" data-end="539">
<li data-start="428" data-end="471">
<p data-start="430" data-end="471">Small underwater thruster = ~200–300 W.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="475" data-end="539">
<p data-start="477" data-end="539">Two motors (one on each paddle end) = ~400–600 W continuous.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="541" data-end="746">
<p data-start="544" data-end="569"><strong data-start="544" data-end="567">Battery size needed</strong></p>
<ul data-start="573" data-end="746">
<li data-start="573" data-end="600">
<p data-start="575" data-end="600">600 W × 1 hr = ~600 Wh.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="604" data-end="640">
<p data-start="606" data-end="640">At 12V = ~50 Ah battery minimum.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="644" data-end="746">
<p data-start="646" data-end="746">To be safe (losses, waves, currents) → <strong data-start="685" data-end="706">12V 100Ah LiFePO4</strong> = ~1.2 kWh → gives 1.5–2 hrs runtime.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="748" data-end="902">
<p data-start="751" data-end="763"><strong data-start="751" data-end="761">Weight</strong></p>
<ul data-start="767" data-end="902">
<li data-start="767" data-end="831">
<p data-start="769" data-end="831">12V 100Ah LiFePO4 ≈ 10–12 kg (manageable, can sit in canoe).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="835" data-end="902">
<p data-start="837" data-end="902">If you want lighter, a 12V 50Ah LiFePO4 ≈ 6 kg → ~1 hr runtime.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="904" data-end="907">
<h2 data-start="909" data-end="929">🟢 Recommendation</h2>
<ul data-start="930" data-end="1089">
<li data-start="930" data-end="1009">
<p data-start="932" data-end="1009">For <strong data-start="936" data-end="968">prototype / proof-of-concept</strong> → 12V 50Ah battery (cheaper, lighter).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1010" data-end="1089">
<p data-start="1012" data-end="1089">For <strong data-start="1016" data-end="1045">rental / real tourist use</strong> → 12V 100Ah battery (guaranteed 1–2 hrs).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1091" data-end="1094">
<p data-start="1096" data-end="1116">⚠️ Very important:</p>
<ul data-start="1117" data-end="1282">
<li data-start="1117" data-end="1206">
<p data-start="1119" data-end="1206">Battery should be in a <strong data-start="1142" data-end="1167">sealed waterproof box</strong> (IP67) with a quick disconnect plug.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1207" data-end="1282">
<p data-start="1209" data-end="1282">Include a <strong data-start="1219" data-end="1243">safety cutoff switch</strong> so renters can instantly kill power.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1284" data-end="1287">
<p data-start="1289" data-end="1386">👉 So yes, <strong data-start="1300" data-end="1342">1-hour minimum runtime is doable today</strong> with off-the-shelf 12V LiFePO4 batteries.</p>
<p data-start="1388" data-end="1518" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Do you want me to put together a <strong data-start="1421" data-end="1466">ready-to-buy battery + waterproof box kit</strong> that would work directly for your paddle prototype?</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10.667V13.5C3.16504 14.21