 good to see what’s out there. Here are suggestions + pros/cons:</p>
<hr data-start="188" data-end="191">
<h2 data-start="193" data-end="232">👀 EU / market-sources for thrusters</h2>
<p data-start="234" data-end="258">From the search results:</p>
<ul data-start="260" data-end="1017">
<li data-start="260" data-end="387">
<p data-start="262" data-end="387"><strong data-start="262" data-end="311">ApisQueen U92 Set (9.2 kg / ~20.3 lbs thrust)</strong> — good size for 2 in an inflatable. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a href="https://n-o-s.eu/Set-Underwater-Thruster-9-2Kg-20-28LB-Thrust/1072049?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://n-o-s.eu/Set-Underwater-Thruster-9-2Kg-20-28LB-Thrust/1072049?utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">Northern Offshore Services</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="388" data-end="508">
<p data-start="390" data-end="508"><strong data-start="390" data-end="438">20 lbs Underwater Thruster, Brushless w/ ESC</strong> (metal shell) — decent match. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a href="https://www.ubuy.com.jm/product/JOOTSOCKM-20lbs-thrust-underwater-power-thruster-brushless-motor-with-esc-metal-shell-with-propeller-suitable-for-kayak-fishing-boat-underwater-robot-and?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://www.ubuy.com.jm/product/JOOTSOCKM-20lbs-thrust-underwater-power-thruster-brushless-motor-with-esc-metal-shell-with-propeller-suitable-for-kayak-fishing-boat-underwater-robot-and?utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">ubuy.com.jm</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="509" data-end="650">
<p data-start="511" data-end="650"><strong data-start="511" data-end="541">BlueRobotics T200 Thruster</strong> — well known, reliable, used by hobbyists for kayaks / small crafts. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a href="https://bluerobotics.com/store/thrusters/t100-t200-thrusters/t200-thruster-r2-rp/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://bluerobotics.com/store/thrusters/t100-t200-thrusters/t200-thruster-r2-rp/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">Blue Robotics</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="651" data-end="834">
<p data-start="653" data-end="834"><strong data-start="653" data-end="695">Aqua Marina BlueDrive K Trolling Motor</strong> — not exactly tip-paddle but for inflatable boats &amp; canoes, modest speed; good for lighter assist. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a href="https://easy-surfshop.com/do/item/AM-PF-240K/Electric-Trolling-Motor-Aqua-Marina-BlueDrive-K?srsltid=AfmBOopAcnzMpAhvqdvZY5VDG2DC_aNbtbZh7oVVy4tZeJAJ1jfd7Dgu&amp;utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://easy-surfshop.com/do/item/AM-PF-240K/Electric-Trolling-Motor-Aqua-Marina-BlueDrive-K?srsltid=AfmBOopAcnzMpAhvqdvZY5VDG2DC_aNbtbZh7oVVy4tZeJAJ1jfd7Dgu&amp;utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">EASY-surfshop.com</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="835" data-end="1017">
<p data-start="837" data-end="1017"><strong data-start="837" data-end="870">Haswing 55 lbs Trolling Motor</strong> (55 lbs / ~25 kgf thrust) — quite strong, maybe overpowered for paddle ends, but gives margin in currents. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a href="https://aquarib.eu/shop/19-outboard---electric/181-haswing-electric-trolling-motor-55lbs---66-cm-shaft/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://aquarib.eu/shop/19-outboard---electric/181-haswing-electric-trolling-motor-55lbs---66-cm-shaft/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">aquarib.eu</span><span class="-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]">+1</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1019" data-end="1022">
