2">social media share button</strong> on your <strong data-start="61" data-end="87">IonianEMS product page</strong> — so users can click and share it directly.</p>
<p data-start="135" data-end="232">Since your frontend is a <strong data-start="160" data-end="185">static Next.js export</strong> (Creta Force), here’s the simplest approach:</p>
<hr data-start="234" data-end="237">
<h2 data-start="239" data-end="284">🔘 Example Share Buttons (React / Next.js)</h2>
