full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="72">Perfect 👍 thanks for sharing the full code of your <strong data-start="52" data-end="69">ProductScreen</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="74" data-end="250">We can drop in <strong data-start="89" data-end="113">social share buttons</strong> right below the product description (or anywhere you want).<br data-start="173" data-end="176">
Since you’re using <strong data-start="195" data-end="214">React Bootstrap</strong>, I’ll keep the styles consistent.</p>
<hr data-start="252" data-end="255">
<h2 data-start="257" data-end="303">🔘 Updated ProductScreen with Share Buttons</h2>
