 the <strong data-start="20" data-end="36">cleanest way</strong> if you plan to use the same share buttons on <strong data-start="82" data-end="100">multiple pages</strong> (like product screen, blog posts, promotions, etc.).</p>
<p data-start="157" data-end="295">Instead of repeating the button code inside <code data-start="201" data-end="216">ProductScreen</code>, you make a <strong data-start="229" data-end="257"><code data-start="231" data-end="245">ShareButtons</code> component</strong> and just drop it where you need it.</p>
<hr data-start="297" data-end="300">
<h2 data-start="302" data-end="351">🔧 Step 1: Create <code data-start="323" data-end="351">components/ShareButtons.js</code></h2>
