</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">const</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">ShareButtons</span></span><span> = (</span><span><span class="hljs-params">{ url, text }</span></span><span>) =&gt; {
  </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">const</span></span><span> pageUrl = </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">encodeURIComponent</span></span><span>(url);
  </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">const</span></span><span> shareText = </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">encodeURIComponent</span></span><span>(text);

  </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">return</span></span><span> (
    </span><span><span class="language-xml"><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">div</span></span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">style</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{{</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">marginTop:</span></span><span> "</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">10px</span></span><span>", </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">display:</span></span><span> "</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">flex</span></span><span>", </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">gap:</span></span><span> "</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">10px</span></span><span>", </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">flexWrap:</span></span><span> "</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">wrap</span></span><span>" }}&gt;
      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">a</span></span></span><span>
        </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">href</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{</span></span><span>`</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">https:</span></span><span>//</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">www.facebook.com</span></span><span>/</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">sharer</span></span><span>/</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">sharer.php</span></span><span>?</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">u</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">${pageUrl}</span></span><span>`}
        </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">target</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"_blank"</span></span><span>
        </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">rel</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"noopener noreferrer"</span></span><span>
        </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">className</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"btn btn-primary btn-sm"</span></span><span>
      &gt;
        Facebook
      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">a</span></span></span><span>&gt;

      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">a</span></span></span><span>
        </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">href</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{</span></span><span>`</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">https:</span></span><span>//</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">twitter.com</span></span><span>/</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">intent</span></span><span>/</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">tweet</span></span><span>?</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">url</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">${pageUrl}&amp;text</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">${shareText}</span></span><span>`}
        </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">target</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"_blank"</span></span><span>
        </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">rel</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"noopener noreferrer"</span></span><span>
        </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">className</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"btn btn-info btn-sm"</span></span><span>
      &gt;
        X
      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">a</span></span></span><span>&gt;

      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">a</span></span></span><span>
        </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">href</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{</span></span><span>`</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">https:</span></span><span>//</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">www.linkedin.com</span></span><span>/</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">sharing</span></span><span>/</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">share-offsite</span></span><span>/?</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">url</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">${pageUrl}</span></span><span>`}
        </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">target</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"_blank"</span></span><span>
        </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">rel</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"noopener noreferrer"</span></span><span>
        </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">className</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"btn btn-secondary btn-sm"</span></span><span>
      &gt;
        LinkedIn
      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">a</span></span></span><span>&gt;

      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">a</span></span></span><span>
        </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">href</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{</span></span><span>`</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">https:</span></span><span>//</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">api.whatsapp.com</span></span><span>/</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">send</span></span><span>?</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">text</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">${shareText}%20${pageUrl}</span></span><span>`}
        </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">target</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"_blank"</span></span><span>
        </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">rel</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"noopener noreferrer"</span></span><span>
        </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">className</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"btn btn-success btn-sm"</span></span><span>
      &gt;
        WhatsApp
      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">a</span></span></span><span>&gt;
    </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">div</span></span></span><span>&gt;
  );
};

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">export</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">default</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">ShareButtons</span></span><span>;
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
