  </span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">Description</span></span><span>: {product.</span><span><span class="hljs-property">description</span></span><span>}
&lt;/</span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">ListGroup</span></span><span>.</span><span><span class="hljs-property">Item</span></span><span>&gt;

</span><span><span class="language-xml"><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">ListGroup.Item</span></span></span></span><span>&gt;
  </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">strong</span></span></span><span>&gt;Share this product:</span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">strong</span></span></span><span>&gt;
  </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">ShareButtons</span></span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">url</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{</span></span><span>`</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">https:</span></span><span>//</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">ionianems.com</span></span><span>/</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">product</span></span><span>/${</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">product._id</span></span><span>}`}
    </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">text</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{</span></span><span>`</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">Check</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">out</span></span><span> ${</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">product.name</span></span><span>} </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">on</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">IonianEMS</span></span><span>!`}
  /&gt;
</span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">ListGroup.Item</span></span></span><span>&gt;
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="2399" data-end="2402">
<h2 data-start="2404" data-end="2426">✅ After this change</h2>
<ul data-start="2427" data-end="2649">
<li data-start="2427" data-end="2524">
<p data-start="2429" data-end="2524">Each product page will show a <strong data-start="2459" data-end="2477">row of buttons</strong>: Facebook, X, LinkedIn, WhatsApp, Copy Link.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2525" data-end="2595">
<p data-start="2527" data-end="2595">Clicking any will redirect to the correct platform’s share dialog.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2596" data-end="2649">
<p data-start="2598" data-end="2649">Copy button works instantly with a browser alert.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2651" data-end="2654">
<p data-start="2656" data-end="2772" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Do you want me to also give you the <strong data-start="2692" data-end="2715">react-icons version</strong> so the buttons look like the real logos instead of text?</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10.667V13.5C3.16504 14.211 3.16593 14.7