<h2 data-start="2631" data-end="2642">✅ Result</h2>
<ul data-start="2643" data-end="2815">
<li data-start="2643" data-end="2815">
<p data-start="2645" data-end="2689">You’ll now see <strong data-start="2660" data-end="2682">round icon buttons</strong> for:</p>
<ul data-start="2692" data-end="2815">
<li data-start="2692" data-end="2711">
<p data-start="2694" data-end="2711">Facebook (blue)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2714" data-end="2741">
<p data-start="2716" data-end="2741">X (Twitter, black/blue)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2744" data-end="2763">
<p data-start="2746" data-end="2763">LinkedIn (blue)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2766" data-end="2786">
<p data-start="2768" data-end="2786">WhatsApp (green)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2789" data-end="2815">
<p data-start="2791" data-end="2815">Copy Link (gray/black)</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="2817" data-end="2892">Super clean, modern, and consistent with your Next.js + Bootstrap layout.</p>
