<h3 data-start="569" data-end="591">🔍 Possible causes</h3>
<ol data-start="592" data-end="1325">
<li data-start="592" data-end="957">
<p data-start="595" data-end="618"><strong data-start="595" data-end="618">Image path mismatch</strong></p>
<ul data-start="622" data-end="957">
<li data-start="622" data-end="880">
