<p data-start="815" data-end="880">✅ Works only if your backend serves <code data-start="851" data-end="861">/uploads</code> as static files.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="884" data-end="957">
<p data-start="886" data-end="957">If your backend doesn’t expose <code data-start="917" data-end="927">/uploads</code>, you’ll get a broken image.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="959" data-end="1180">
<p data-start="962" data-end="1000"><strong data-start="962" data-end="1000">Backend not serving static uploads</strong></p>
<ul data-start="1004" data-end="1180">
<li data-start="1004" data-end="1180">
<p data-start="1006" data-end="1027">In Express, you need:</p>
