<h2 data-start="1095" data-end="1112">🔍 Quick check</h2>
<p data-start="1113" data-end="1161">Try to open that URL directly in your browser:</p>
<p data-start="1163" data-end="1277">👉 <code data-start="1166" data-end="1275">https://ionianems-backend-hkgghubjeqgyctdc.italynorth-01.azurewebsites.net/uploads/image-1758702948881.webp</code></p>
<ul data-start="1279" data-end="1393">
<li data-start="1279" data-end="1323">
<p data-start="1281" data-end="1323">If you see the image → frontend is fine.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1324" data-end="1393">
