<p data-start="866" data-end="1005">That’s correct, because Express will map <code data-start="907" data-end="921">/uploads/...</code>.<br data-start="922" data-end="925">
👉 But make sure the actual file is really in <code data-start="971" data-end="981">/uploads</code> folder on the server.</p>
<hr data-start="1007" data-end="1010">
<h3 data-start="1012" data-end="1036">4️⃣ Check Azure logs</h3>
<p data-start="1037" data-end="1069">Run in Azure console (Kudu/SSH):</p>
