01057 5.53708 6.00551 6.00391 6.00391C6.00551 5.53708 6.01057 5.14051 6.03809 4.80371C6.0755 4.34588 6.15483 3.94012 6.34668 3.56348L6.46875 3.34473C6.77282 2.84912 7.20856 2.44514 7.72949 2.17969L7.87207 2.11328C8.20855 1.96886 8.56979 1.90385 8.9707 1.87109C9.42091 1.83432 9.978 1.83496 10.667 1.83496H13.5C14.1891 1.83496 14.746 1.83431 15.1963 1.87109C15.6541 1.90851 16.0599 1.98788 16.4365 2.17969L16.6553 2.30176C17.151 2.60585 17.5548 3.04244 17.8203 3.56348L17.8867 3.70606C18.031 4.04235 18.0962 4.40306 18.1289 4.80371C18.1657 5.25395 18.165 5.81091 18.165 6.5V9.33301Z"></path></svg>Copy code</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">ls</span></span><span> /home/site/wwwroot/uploads
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1112" data-end="1198">If it’s empty → your upload process didn’t save there, or the folder never deployed.</p>
<hr data-start="1200" data-end="1203">
<h3 data-start="1205" data-end="1219">🔑 Summary</h3>
<ul data-start="1220" data-end="1598">
<li data-start="1220" data-end="1287">
<p data-start="1222" data-end="1287">If <code data-start="1225" data-end="1235">/uploads</code> folder is missing → create it in repo + redeploy.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1288" data-end="1370">
<p data-start="1290" data-end="1370">If <code data-start="1293" data-end="1303">/uploads</code> is there locally but not on Azure → add <code data-start="1344" data-end="1354">.gitkeep</code> and redeploy.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1371" data-end="1483">
<p data-start="1373" data-end="1483">If <code data-start="1376" data-end="1386">/uploads</code> is there but empty → check your <code data-start="1419" data-end="1436">uploadRoutes.js</code> to ensure files are written into <code data-start="1470" data-end="1480">uploads/</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1484" data-end="1598">
<p data-start="1486" data-end="1598">If everything works locally but fails after redeploy → you need persistent storage (Azure Blob or Cloudinary).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1600" data-end="1603">
<p data-start="1605" data-end="1729" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">👉 Do you want me to give you the <strong data-start="1639" data-end="1658">quick test code</strong> to verify if Express is actually serving a dummy file from <code data-start="1718" data-end="1728">/uploads</code>?</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.9