057 5.53708 6.00551 6.00391 6.00391C6.00551 5.53708 6.01057 5.14051 6.03809 4.80371C6.0755 4.34588 6.15483 3.94012 6.34668 3.56348L6.46875 3.34473C6.77282 2.84912 7.20856 2.44514 7.72949 2.17969L7.87207 2.11328C8.20855 1.96886 8.56979 1.90385 8.9707 1.87109C9.42091 1.83432 9.978 1.83496 10.667 1.83496H13.5C14.1891 1.83496 14.746 1.83431 15.1963 1.87109C15.6541 1.90851 16.0599 1.98788 16.4365 2.17969L16.6553 2.30176C17.151 2.60585 17.5548 3.04244 17.8203 3.56348L17.8867 3.70606C18.031 4.04235 18.0962 4.40306 18.1289 4.80371C18.1657 5.25395 18.165 5.81091 18.165 6.5V9.33301Z"></path></svg>Copy code</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">ls</span></span><span> /home/site/wwwroot/uploads
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
</li>
<li data-start="908" data-end="1094">
<p data-start="910" data-end="932">Do you see the file?</p>
<ul data-start="938" data-end="1094">
<li data-start="938" data-end="999">
<p data-start="940" data-end="999">If empty → file isn’t uploaded or folder wasn’t deployed.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1005" data-end="1094">
<p data-start="1007" data-end="1094">If the file is there → then Express should serve it, meaning maybe wrong permissions.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="1096" data-end="1469">
<p data-start="1099" data-end="1127"><strong data-start="1099" data-end="1125">Test with a dummy file</strong></p>
<ul data-start="1131" data-end="1469">
<li data-start="1131" data-end="1197">
<p data-start="1133" data-end="1197">Manually put a test file (e.g., <code data-start="1165" data-end="1175">test.txt</code>) inside <code data-start="1184" data-end="1194">/uploads</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1201" data-end="1212">
<p data-start="1203" data-end="1212">Deploy.</p>
</li>
