<hr data-start="1471" data-end="1474">
<p data-start="1476" data-end="1684">⚠️ Important: On Azure, <code data-start="1500" data-end="1510">/uploads</code> is <strong data-start="1514" data-end="1532">not persistent</strong> → files disappear after each redeploy.<br data-start="1571" data-end="1574">
That’s why many apps (including ecommerce) use <strong data-start="1621" data-end="1653">Cloudinary / S3 / Azure Blob</strong> instead of local <code data-start="1671" data-end="1681">/uploads</code>.</p>
<hr data-start="1686" data-end="1689">
