57 5.53708 6.00551 6.00391 6.00391C6.00551 5.53708 6.01057 5.14051 6.03809 4.80371C6.0755 4.34588 6.15483 3.94012 6.34668 3.56348L6.46875 3.34473C6.77282 2.84912 7.20856 2.44514 7.72949 2.17969L7.87207 2.11328C8.20855 1.96886 8.56979 1.90385 8.9707 1.87109C9.42091 1.83432 9.978 1.83496 10.667 1.83496H13.5C14.1891 1.83496 14.746 1.83431 15.1963 1.87109C15.6541 1.90851 16.0599 1.98788 16.4365 2.17969L16.6553 2.30176C17.151 2.60585 17.5548 3.04244 17.8203 3.56348L17.8867 3.70606C18.031 4.04235 18.0962 4.40306 18.1289 4.80371C18.1657 5.25395 18.165 5.81091 18.165 6.5V9.33301Z"></path></svg>Copy code</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-jsx"><span><span>&lt;</span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">Image</span></span><span>
  src={product.</span><span><span class="hljs-property">image</span></span><span>}
  alt={product.</span><span><span class="hljs-property">name</span></span><span>}
  fluid
  style={{ </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">maxWidth</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-string">'100%'</span></span><span>, </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">height</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-string">'auto'</span></span><span>, </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">objectFit</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-string">'contain'</span></span><span> }}
/&gt;
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="978" data-end="981">
<h2 data-start="983" data-end="1003">🔍 Why this works</h2>
<ul data-start="1004" data-end="1240">
<li data-start="1004" data-end="1093">
<p data-start="1006" data-end="1093"><code data-start="1006" data-end="1023">uploadRoutes.js</code> already returns Cloudinary URLs (<code data-start="1057" data-end="1089">https://res.cloudinary.com/...</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1094" data-end="1161">
<p data-start="1096" data-end="1161">Your DB should store those full URLs instead of <code data-start="1144" data-end="1158">/uploads/...</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1162" data-end="1240">
<p data-start="1164" data-end="1240">When <code data-start="1169" data-end="1184">ProductScreen</code> renders, it will always point directly to Cloudinary.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1242" data-end="1245">
