57 5.53708 6.00551 6.00391 6.00391C6.00551 5.53708 6.01057 5.14051 6.03809 4.80371C6.0755 4.34588 6.15483 3.94012 6.34668 3.56348L6.46875 3.34473C6.77282 2.84912 7.20856 2.44514 7.72949 2.17969L7.87207 2.11328C8.20855 1.96886 8.56979 1.90385 8.9707 1.87109C9.42091 1.83432 9.978 1.83496 10.667 1.83496H13.5C14.1891 1.83496 14.746 1.83431 15.1963 1.87109C15.6541 1.90851 16.0599 1.98788 16.4365 2.17969L16.6553 2.30176C17.151 2.60585 17.5548 3.04244 17.8203 3.56348L17.8867 3.70606C18.031 4.04235 18.0962 4.40306 18.1289 4.80371C18.1657 5.25395 18.165 5.81091 18.165 6.5V9.33301Z"></path></svg>Copy code</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-jsx"><span><span>&lt;</span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">Image</span></span><span>
  src={product.</span><span><span class="hljs-property">image</span></span><span>}
  alt={product.</span><span><span class="hljs-property">name</span></span><span>}
  fluid
  style={{ </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">maxWidth</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-string">'100%'</span></span><span>, </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">height</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-string">'auto'</span></span><span>, </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">objectFit</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-string">'contain'</span></span><span> }}
/&gt;
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="691" data-end="694">
<h2 data-start="696" data-end="716">🔍 Why this works</h2>
<ul data-start="717" data-end="968">
<li data-start="717" data-end="806">
<p data-start="719" data-end="806"><code data-start="719" data-end="736">uploadRoutes.js</code> always returns a Cloudinary URL (<code data-start="770" data-end="802">https://res.cloudinary.com/...</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="807" data-end="861">
<p data-start="809" data-end="861">That URL is saved into <code data-start="832" data-end="847">product.image</code> in MongoDB.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="862" data-end="918">
<p data-start="864" data-end="918">Your frontend should trust that and use it directly.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="919" data-end="968">
<p data-start="921" data-end="968">No more <code data-start="929" data-end="943">/uploads/...</code> dead links from Azure.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="970" data-end="973">
<p data-start="975" data-end="1162" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">👉 Do you want me to also give you a <strong data-start="1012" data-end="1037">safety fallback image</strong> (like a placeholder picture) in case <code data-start="1075" data-end="1090">product.image</code> is missing? That way new products without uploads don’t break the page.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49