<h3 data-start="603" data-end="623">✅ What this does</h3>
<ul data-start="624" data-end="822">
<li data-start="624" data-end="685">
<p data-start="626" data-end="685">Always uses the Cloudinary URL stored in <code data-start="667" data-end="682">product.image</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="686" data-end="822">
<p data-start="688" data-end="822">If <code data-start="691" data-end="706">product.image</code> is missing, it falls back to <code data-start="736" data-end="754">/placeholder.png</code> (you can put a simple placeholder image in your <code data-start="803" data-end="811">public</code> folder).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="824" data-end="827">
