</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="562" data-end="577">and redeploy.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="581" data-end="622">
<p data-start="583" data-end="622">This regenerates static HTML for SEO.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="626" data-end="647">
<p data-start="628" data-end="647">Simple, but manual.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="649" data-end="1031">
<p data-start="652" data-end="707"><strong data-start="652" data-end="705">Switch from <code data-start="666" data-end="679">next export</code> to real Next.js hosting</strong></p>
<ul data-start="711" data-end="1031">
<li data-start="711" data-end="766">
<p data-start="713" data-end="766">Deploy to <strong data-start="723" data-end="763">Vercel, Netlify, or your Node server</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="770" data-end="863">
<p data-start="772" data-end="789">Then you can use:</p>
