<li data-start="867" data-end="978">
<p data-start="869" data-end="978">This gives <strong data-start="880" data-end="895">perfect SEO</strong> and also supports <strong data-start="914" data-end="940">new products instantly</strong> (they’re generated on first visit).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="982" data-end="1031">
<p data-start="984" data-end="1031">Best option if you want SEO + less manual work.</p>
</li>
