<hr data-start="2059" data-end="2062">
<h1 data-start="2064" data-end="2099">🚀 Step 4: Configure domain + SSL</h1>
<ol data-start="2100" data-end="2332">
<li data-start="2100" data-end="2146">
<p data-start="2103" data-end="2146">In your App Service → <strong data-start="2125" data-end="2143">Custom Domains</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2147" data-end="2197">
<p data-start="2150" data-end="2197">Add <code data-start="2154" data-end="2173">www.ionianems.com</code> (and root if needed).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2198" data-end="2258">
<p data-start="2201" data-end="2258">Update your DNS (CNAME → <code data-start="2226" data-end="2254">your-app.azurewebsites.net</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2259" data-end="2332">
<p data-start="2262" data-end="2332">Enable <strong data-start="2269" data-end="2309">Free App Service Managed Certificate</strong> in TLS/SSL settings.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="2334" data-end="2337">
