</li>
<li data-start="2452" data-end="2535">
<p data-start="2454" data-end="2535">✅ Now it should load, even for new products (thanks to <code data-start="2509" data-end="2531">fallback: 'blocking'</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2536" data-end="2577">
<p data-start="2538" data-end="2577">✅ Google sees full SEO <code data-start="2561" data-end="2569">&lt;meta&gt;</code> tags.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2579" data-end="2582">
<h1 data-start="2584" data-end="2598">🔑 Key Notes</h1>
<ul data-start="2599" data-end="2810">
<li data-start="2599" data-end="2651">
<p data-start="2601" data-end="2651">You no longer need <code data-start="2620" data-end="2633">next export</code> or Creta Force.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2652" data-end="2717">
<p data-start="2654" data-end="2717">You can still keep backend + frontend in separate Azure apps.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2718" data-end="2810">
<p data-start="2720" data-end="2810">Each time you deploy, old products are pre-rendered; new ones are generated dynamically.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2812" data-end="2815">
