ta-end="53">Exactly ✅ — you <strong data-start="16" data-end="50">don’t need to rewrite your app</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="55" data-end="75">The big change is:</p>
<ul data-start="76" data-end="171">
<li data-start="76" data-end="118">
<p data-start="78" data-end="118"><strong data-start="78" data-end="106">Stop using <code data-start="91" data-end="104">next export</code></strong> (static).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="119" data-end="171">
<p data-start="121" data-end="171"><strong data-start="121" data-end="159">Deploy it as a real Next.js server</strong> on Azure.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="173" data-end="176">
<h3 data-start="178" data-end="217">🔧 What you actually need to change</h3>
<ol data-start="218" data-end="759">
<li data-start="218" data-end="412">
<p data-start="221" data-end="260">In <code data-start="224" data-end="238">package.json</code> → make sure you have:</p>
