 6.01057 5.53708 6.00551 6.00391 6.00391C6.00551 5.53708 6.01057 5.14051 6.03809 4.80371C6.0755 4.34588 6.15483 3.94012 6.34668 3.56348L6.46875 3.34473C6.77282 2.84912 7.20856 2.44514 7.72949 2.17969L7.87207 2.11328C8.20855 1.96886 8.56979 1.90385 8.9707 1.87109C9.42091 1.83432 9.978 1.83496 10.667 1.83496H13.5C14.1891 1.83496 14.746 1.83431 15.1963 1.87109C15.6541 1.90851 16.0599 1.98788 16.4365 2.17969L16.6553 2.30176C17.151 2.60585 17.5548 3.04244 17.8203 3.56348L17.8867 3.70606C18.031 4.04235 18.0962 4.40306 18.1289 4.80371C18.1657 5.25395 18.165 5.81091 18.165 6.5V9.33301Z"></path></svg>Copy code</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre!"><span><span><span class="hljs-section">Host: www</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-section">Value: ionianems-frontend.azurewebsites.net</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-section">TTL: 1h</span></span><span>
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
</li>
<li data-start="1077" data-end="1216">
<p data-start="1079" data-end="1216">If you want the <strong data-start="1095" data-end="1110">root domain</strong> (<code data-start="1112" data-end="1127">ionianems.com</code> without www), add an <strong data-start="1149" data-end="1161">A record</strong> pointing to Azure’s IP (App Service gives you this).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1218" data-end="1221">
<h3 data-start="1223" data-end="1248">4. Enable SSL (HTTPS)</h3>
<ul data-start="1249" data-end="1464">
<li data-start="1249" data-end="1387">
<p data-start="1251" data-end="1387">In Azure App Service → <strong data-start="1274" data-end="1294">TLS/SSL settings</strong> → <strong data-start="1297" data-end="1332">Private Key Certificates (.pfx)</strong> → select <strong data-start="1342" data-end="1384">Create App Service Managed Certificate</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1388" data-end="1439">
<p data-start="1390" data-end="1439">Assign it to your domain (<code data-start="1416" data-end="1435">www.ionianems.com</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1440" data-end="1464">
<p data-start="1442" data-end="1464">✅ Free SSL included.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1466" data-end="1469">
<h3 data-start="1471" data-end="1525">5. Redirect root → www (optional but good for SEO)</h3>
<p data-start="1526" data-end="1661">In Azure <strong data-start="1535" data-end="1549">Front Door</strong> or in App Service settings, you can force all traffic from <code data-start="1609" data-end="1624">ionianems.com</code> → <code data-start="1627" data-end="1646">www.ionianems.com</code> (canonical).</p>
<hr data-start="1663" data-end="1666">
<h2 data-start="1668" data-end="1681">📌 Summary</h2>
<ul data-start="1682" data-end="1955">
<li data-start="1682" data-end="1798">
<p data-start="1684" data-end="1798">Keep backend domain = your Azure backend (<code data-start="1726" data-end="1794">ionianems-backend-hkgghubjeqgyctdc.italynorth-01.azurewebsites.net</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1799" data-end="1879">
<p data-start="1801" data-end="1879">Move frontend domain = <code data-start="1824" data-end="1843">www.ionianems.com</code> → new Azure frontend App Service.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1880" data-end="1918">
<p data-start="1882" data-end="1918">DNS change = update CNAME → Azure.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1919" data-end="1955">
<p data-start="1921" data-end="1955">SSL = managed by Azure for free.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1957" data-end="1960">
<p data-start="1962" data-end="2121" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">👉 Do you want me to prepare the <strong data-start="1995" data-end="2016">exact DNS records</strong> you’ll need to add, if you tell me who your domain registrar is (e.g., GoDaddy, Cloudflare, SiteGround)?</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.165