art="0" data-end="90">Yes 👍 that’s the correct form, <strong data-start="32" data-end="69">as long as you’re using backticks</strong> around the string.</p>
<p data-start="92" data-end="192">If you accidentally used quotes instead of backticks, the browser will literally treat it as text:</p>
