</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="343" data-end="516">👉 That means <strong data-start="357" data-end="427">only the products that existed at build time are generated as HTML</strong>.<br data-start="428" data-end="431">
Any <strong data-start="435" data-end="468">new product added after build</strong> → doesn’t exist in <code data-start="488" data-end="494">/out</code> → Nginx serves <code data-start="510" data-end="515">404</code>.</p>
<hr data-start="518" data-end="521">
<h3 data-start="523" data-end="539">✅ How to fix</h3>
<p data-start="540" data-end="611">You need <strong data-start="549" data-end="576">dynamic page generation</strong> instead of a frozen static export:</p>
<ol data-start="613" data-end="651">
<li data-start="613" data-end="651">
<p data-start="616" data-end="651">In <code data-start="619" data-end="642">pages/product/[id].js</code>, change:</p>
</li>
</ol>
