<p data-start="715" data-end="866">✅ This should work for both.<br data-start="743" data-end="746">
But if <code data-start="753" data-end="768">product.image</code> is <strong data-start="772" data-end="781">empty</strong> or malformed, the <code data-start="800" data-end="809">&lt;Image&gt;</code> will try to fetch something invalid → Nginx returns 404.</p>
