<p data-start="990" data-end="1021">Then check the browser console:</p>
<ul data-start="1022" data-end="1213">
<li data-start="1022" data-end="1081">
<p data-start="1024" data-end="1081">If you see <code data-start="1035" data-end="1049">/uploads/...</code> → backend URL should resolve.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1082" data-end="1156">
<p data-start="1084" data-end="1156">If you see <code data-start="1095" data-end="1127">https://res.cloudinary.com/...</code> → should display directly.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1157" data-end="1213">
<p data-start="1159" data-end="1213">If you see <code data-start="1170" data-end="1181">undefined</code> or <code data-start="1185" data-end="1189">""</code> → that’s why it breaks.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1215" data-end="1218">
<p data-start="1220" data-end="1404" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">👉 Question:<br data-start="1232" data-end="1235">
