tart="37" data-end="75">force a fallback placeholder image</strong> any time the real one can’t be loaded. That way you’ll <strong data-start="131" data-end="140">never</strong> see a broken 404 box again.</p>
<p data-start="172" data-end="218">Here’s how you can update your <code data-start="203" data-end="212">&lt;Image&gt;</code> code:</p>
