57 5.53708 6.00551 6.00391 6.00391C6.00551 5.53708 6.01057 5.14051 6.03809 4.80371C6.0755 4.34588 6.15483 3.94012 6.34668 3.56348L6.46875 3.34473C6.77282 2.84912 7.20856 2.44514 7.72949 2.17969L7.87207 2.11328C8.20855 1.96886 8.56979 1.90385 8.9707 1.87109C9.42091 1.83432 9.978 1.83496 10.667 1.83496H13.5C14.1891 1.83496 14.746 1.83431 15.1963 1.87109C15.6541 1.90851 16.0599 1.98788 16.4365 2.17969L16.6553 2.30176C17.151 2.60585 17.5548 3.04244 17.8203 3.56348L17.8867 3.70606C18.031 4.04235 18.0962 4.40306 18.1289 4.80371C18.1657 5.25395 18.165 5.81091 18.165 6.5V9.33301Z"></path></svg>Copy code</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-jsx"><span><span>&lt;</span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">Image</span></span><span>
  src={
    product.</span><span><span class="hljs-property">image</span></span><span>?.</span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">startsWith</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-string">'http'</span></span><span>)
      ? product.</span><span><span class="hljs-property">image</span></span><span>
      : product.</span><span><span class="hljs-property">image</span></span><span>
        ? </span><span><span class="hljs-string">`https://ionianems-backend-hkgghubjeqgyctdc.italynorth-01.azurewebsites.net<span class="hljs-subst">${product.image}</span></span></span><span>`
        : </span><span><span class="hljs-string">'/images/placeholder.png'</span></span><span>  </span><span><span class="hljs-comment">// ✅ fallback if no image</span></span><span>
  }
  alt={product.</span><span><span class="hljs-property">name</span></span><span>}
  fluid
  style={{ </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">maxWidth</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-string">'100%'</span></span><span>, </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">height</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-string">'auto'</span></span><span>, </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">objectFit</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-string">'contain'</span></span><span> }}
  onError={</span><span><span class="hljs-function">(<span class="hljs-params">e</span></span></span><span>) =&gt; {
    e.</span><span><span class="hljs-property">target</span></span><span>.</span><span><span class="hljs-property">onerror</span></span><span> = </span><span><span class="hljs-literal">null</span></span><span>; 
    e.</span><span><span class="hljs-property">target</span></span><span>.</span><span><span class="hljs-property">src</span></span><span> = </span><span><span class="hljs-string">'/images/placeholder.png'</span></span><span>; </span><span><span class="hljs-comment">// ✅ fallback if broken URL</span></span><span>
  }}
/&gt;
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="729" data-end="732">
<h3 data-start="734" data-end="755">🔑 Why this works</h3>
<ul data-start="756" data-end="1079">
<li data-start="756" data-end="828">
<p data-start="758" data-end="828">If the product already has a <strong data-start="787" data-end="805">Cloudinary URL</strong> → it shows directly.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="829" data-end="899">
<p data-start="831" data-end="899">If it’s a <strong data-start="841" data-end="865">relative upload path</strong> → it prepends your backend URL.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="900" data-end="969">
<p data-start="902" data-end="969">If <code data-start="905" data-end="920">product.image</code> is empty → it shows <code data-start="941" data-end="966">/images/placeholder.png</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="970" data-end="1079">
<p data-start="972" data-end="1079">If the URL still fails (404, DNS, typo, etc.) → the <code data-start="1024" data-end="1033">onError</code> handler <strong data-start="1042" data-end="1078">replaces it with the placeholder</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1081" data-end="1084">
<p data-start="1086" data-end="1250" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">👉 Do you want me to also give you a <strong data-start="1123" data-end="1155">ready-to-use placeholder.png</strong> (nice neutral “No Image Available” style) so you can drop it in your <code data-start="1225" data-end="1242">/public/images/</code> folder?</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.