<hr data-start="212" data-end="215">
<h3 data-start="217" data-end="282">Step 2. Save this image as <code data-start="248" data-end="280">/public/images/placeholder.png</code></h3>
<p data-start="284" data-end="328">It’s a <strong data-start="291" data-end="325">clean “No Image Available” PNG</strong>:</p>
<p data-start="330" data-end="422"><div></div></p>
<p data-start="424" data-end="504">Right-click → <strong data-start="438" data-end="449">Save As</strong> → <code data-start="452" data-end="469">placeholder.png</code> → put it inside <code data-start="486" data-end="503">/public/images/</code>.</p>
<hr data-start="506" data-end="509">
<h3 data-start="511" data-end="554">Step 3. Your <code data-start="528" data-end="537">&lt;Image&gt;</code> now works 100%</h3>
