<p data-start="1048" data-end="1057">👉 Now:</p>
<ul data-start="1058" data-end="1170">
<li data-start="1058" data-end="1097">
<p data-start="1060" data-end="1097">If the real image loads → it shows.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1098" data-end="1170">
<p data-start="1100" data-end="1170">If not → you’ll <strong data-start="1116" data-end="1146">always see the placeholder</strong> instead of a 404 box.</p>
</li>
</ul>
