<hr data-start="164" data-end="167">
<h3 data-start="169" data-end="207">🔨 How to add the placeholder file</h3>
<ol data-start="209" data-end="478">
<li data-start="209" data-end="337">
<p data-start="212" data-end="242">In your project folder, go to:</p>
