<p data-start="551" data-end="624">You should see a grey box with <strong data-start="582" data-end="606">“No image available”</strong> text inside it.</p>
<hr data-start="626" data-end="629">
<h3 data-start="631" data-end="652">If you prefer PNG</h3>
<p data-start="653" data-end="792">If you don’t like SVG and want a regular <code data-start="694" data-end="700">.png</code> file (so it always opens like a normal image), you can download this clean placeholder PNG:</p>
